Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.19,0:00:59.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(星期六 1955年11月12日)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.90,0:01:02.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(晚上10点03分)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.33,0:01:24.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.23,0:02:28.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc! Doc! Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.77,0:02:30.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 博士 博士! - 什么事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Doc! Doc! - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.27,0:02:34.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别紧张 博士 是我 马丁!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, relax, Doc. It's me. It's me! It's Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.69,0:02:37.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不可能 我刚刚才把你送回未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it can't be. I just sent you back to the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.24,0:02:38.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 你有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. No, I know. You did send me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.74,0:02:40.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把我送回未来去 但我回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}back to the future, but I'm back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.61,0:02:42.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我又从未来回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm back from the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.99,0:02:47.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great Scott!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.98,0:02:59.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,《回到未来3》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.80,0:05:05.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,孩子们 现在是什么时间?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, kids, what time is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.51,0:05:08.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你好杜德时间!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Howdy Doody time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.81,0:05:11.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great Scott!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.68,0:05:15.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你好杜德时间?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Howdy Doody Time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.23,0:05:20.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,鲍勃和杜德 向你问好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bob Smith and Howdy Do Say Howdy Do to you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.98,0:05:22.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你好杜德时间?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Howdy Doody time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.91,0:05:32.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,日期 星期日 1955年11月13日{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Date. Sunday, November 13, 1955. 7:01 a.m.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.58,0:05:34.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚的时光旅行实验{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last night's time travel experiment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.08,0:05:36.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,显然获致了彻底的成功{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was apparently a complete success.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.08,0:05:38.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,闪电在十点零四分整击中钟塔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lightning struck the clock tower at precisely 10:04 p.m.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.75,0:05:41.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,将不可或缺的十亿瓦特电量 输进时光旅行车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sending the necessary 1.21 gigawatts into the time vehicle,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.67,0:05:43.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,使其在一道灿烂的闪光中消失{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which vanished in a brilliant flash of light{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.96,0:05:46.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在地上留下两条燃烧的胎痕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}leaving a pair of fire trails behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.43,0:05:48.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我因此估计马丁和时光旅行车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I, therefore, assume that Marty and the time vehicle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.59,0:05:52.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,已穿越时空回到了1985年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}were transported forward through time into the year 1985.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.47,0:05:53.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在那之后...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.64,0:05:56.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我记不得在那之后发生了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After that, I can't recall what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.69,0:05:59.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上 我甚至不记得我是怎么回到家的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In fact, I don't even remember how I got home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.56,0:06:01.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或许是那十亿瓦特的电压{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps the gigawatt discharge{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.44,0:06:03.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,加上那时光旅行车所形成的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}coupled with the temporal displacement field{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.23,0:06:04.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,变位力场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}generated by the time vehicle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.78,0:06:06.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对我的脑波造成了伤害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}caused a disruption of my own brain waves{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.74,0:06:09.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,造成了短暂的失忆现象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}resulting in a condition of momentary amnesia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.78,0:06:11.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但 我现在已经想起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indeed, I now recall that moments{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.16,0:06:13.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在时光旅行车消失在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after the time vehicle disappeared{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.16,0:06:14.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,未来之后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into the future,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.29,0:06:16.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我看见一幅马丁的影像{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw a vision of Marty saying{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.46,0:06:18.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我他又从未来回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he had come back from the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.46,0:06:19.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.50,0:06:20.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,毫无疑问的 这是某种幻觉...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Undoubtedly, this was some sort of residual image...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.92,0:06:21.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.97,0:06:31.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 冷静点好吗? 冷静点 是我 马丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, calm down, okay. Just calm down. It's me. It's Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.30,0:06:33.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不! 不可能是你 我已经把你送回未来去了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it can't be you! I sent you back to the future!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.93,0:06:35.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right, Doc. That's right,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.14,0:06:37.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我又从未来回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I came back again. I came back from the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.14,0:06:38.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还记得昨晚的事吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you remember last night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.23,0:06:39.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你昏倒 我带你回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You fainted. I brought you home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.48,0:06:42.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是不可能的! 你不可能在这里!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This can't be happening! You can't be here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.15,0:06:43.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这完全不合理!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't make sense for you to be here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.44,0:06:45.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我无法相信你会在这里!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I refuse to even believe that you are here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.65,0:06:47.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 我在这里 这一切也很合理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, I am here, and it does make sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.65,0:06:50.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是和1985年的你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I came back to 1955 again with you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.28,0:06:53.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一起回到1955年来 因为我们得从贝夫手中抢回一本书!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the you from 1985, 'cause we had to get a book from Biff!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.20,0:06:54.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但在我拿到书后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So once I got the book back,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.37,0:06:56.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那个1985年的你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you, that is the you from 1985,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.16,0:06:57.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,坐在那辆德罗林跑车上 车子被闪电击中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}were in the DeLorean, and it got struck by lightning,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.00,0:07:00.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,回到了1885年!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you got sent back to 1885!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.17,0:07:01.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,1885年?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}1885?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.75,0:07:06.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这真是个令人感兴趣的故事 未来小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a very interesting story, future boy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.80,0:07:09.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但还有一点是说不通的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but there's just one little thing that doesn't make sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.59,0:07:11.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果未来的我现在是在过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the me of the future is now in the past,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.05,0:07:14.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么会知道这一切?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how could you possibly know about it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.51,0:07:15.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你写了一封信给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sent me a letter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.01,0:07:18.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"亲爱的马丁 如果我的计算正确{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Dear Marty, if my calculations are correct,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.27,0:07:19.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你将在看见德罗林跑车被闪电击中后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you will receive this letter immediately after{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.85,0:07:22.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,立刻收到这封信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you saw the DeLorean struck by lightning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.60,0:07:25.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,首先我要向你保证 我一切平安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First, let me assure you that I'm alive and well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.52,0:07:29.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我过去八个月以来 都快乐地活在1885年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been living happily these past eight months in the year 1885.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.65,0:07:31.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那道击中德罗林跑车的闪电{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The lightning bolt that hit the DeLorean{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.20,0:07:32.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,造成电力超载{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}caused a gigawatt overload{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.53,0:07:34.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,烧毁了时光旅行器的电路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which scrambled the time circuits,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.20,0:07:35.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,触发通量电容器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}activated the Flux Capacitor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.87,0:07:38.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把我送回到1885年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and sent me back to 1885.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.87,0:07:40.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,负载的电量造成时光旅行器短路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The overload shorted out the time circuits{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.71,0:07:42.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,并毁了飞行电路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and destroyed the flying circuits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.75,0:07:45.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很不幸 这辆车再也不能飞了"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unfortunately, the car will never fly again."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.50,0:07:46.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它真的飞起来了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It actually flew?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.88,0:07:48.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 我们在21世纪初期{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we had a hover conversion done{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.63,0:07:50.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,将它改装成能飞的动力系统{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the early 21st century.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.22,0:07:52.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,令人难以置信!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Incredible!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.22,0:07:55.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"我在此以铁匠的身份出现 藉以掩护我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I set myself up as a blacksmith as a front{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.39,0:07:58.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从事将时光旅行器修复的工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while I attempted to repair the damage to the time circuits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.77,0:08:00.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不幸的是 一切努力都是枉然的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unfortunately, this proved impossible,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.68,0:08:02.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为合适的零件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because suitable replacement parts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.31,0:08:05.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,得要到1947年才会发明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will not be invented until 1947.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.65,0:08:07.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,无论如何 我如今已经很能适应{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However, I've gotten quite adept{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.27,0:08:10.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,钉马蹄铁和修蓬车的日子"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at shoeing horses and fixing wagons."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.74,0:08:14.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真叫人想不到!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}1885! Amazing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.78,0:08:18.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的回到当年的西部时代 并成为一个铁匠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I actually end up as a blacksmith in the Old West.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.45,0:08:19.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很正点吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty heavy, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.91,0:08:22.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"我已经把德罗林跑车埋在靠近靴子山老墓园的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I have buried the DeLorean in the abandoned Delgado Mine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.91,0:08:25.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,戴尔加多废矿坑内{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}adjacent to the old Boot Hill Cemetery{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.33,0:08:27.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我已注明在信里所附的地图上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as shown on the enclosed map.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.59,0:08:29.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但愿它能原封不动地保存在那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hopefully, it should remain undisturbed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.21,0:08:32.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,直到你在1955年将它掘出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and preserved until you uncover it in 1955.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.93,0:08:37.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你会在车里找到修复的说明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inside, you will find repair instructions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.76,0:08:41.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我那位1955年的副本..." 就是我啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My 1955 counterpart..." That's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.31,0:08:42.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"将能轻易地将它修复{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"...should have no problem repairing it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.89,0:08:45.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让你开着它回到未来去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so that you can drive it back to the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.56,0:08:49.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在你回到1985年之后 就把这辆时光旅行车毁掉"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once you have returned to 1985, destroy the time machine."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.61,0:08:51.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把它毁掉?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Destroy it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.19,0:08:54.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 这说来话长 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Well, it's a long story, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.36,0:08:57.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"千万不要 我再强调一次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Do not, I repeat, do not attempt{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.32,0:08:59.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要企图回来这里救我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to come back here to get me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.95,0:09:04.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在的生活很快乐 这里有着新鲜的空气 和广阔的生活空间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am perfectly happy living in the fresh air and wide-open spaces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.12,0:09:06.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为没有必要的时光旅行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I fear that unnecessary time travel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.71,0:09:08.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只会对时空的连续性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}only risks further disruption{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.46,0:09:10.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,造成更严重的破坏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the space-time continuum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.50,0:09:13.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有 请替我照顾爱因斯坦"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And please take care of Einstein for me."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.51,0:09:16.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爱因斯坦?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Einstein?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.72,0:09:21.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是你的狗 博士 1985年的你把你的狗命名为爱因斯坦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's your dog, Doc. Einstein is what you call your dog in 1985.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.14,0:09:26.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"我知道你会给他一个舒服的窝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I know you will give him a good home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.19,0:09:27.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,记着要每天带他去散步两次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember to walk him twice a day{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.81,0:09:30.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且他只喜欢罐头狗食{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that he only likes canned dog food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.27,0:09:33.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,以上是我要交待的事 请尊重我的意思 并确实做到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are my wishes. Please respect them and follow them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.57,0:09:37.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 马丁 我在此向你道别 并祝你能够平安回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so, Marty, I now say farewell and wish you Godspeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.03,0:09:40.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一直是我忠实的好朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been a good, kind, and loyal friend to me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.66,0:09:43.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你对我的一生带来重大的影响{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you made a real difference in my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.45,0:09:45.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我将永远珍惜我们的友谊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will always treasure our relationship{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.00,0:09:47.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,回忆你我共渡的美好时光{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and think on you with fond memories,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.00,0:09:51.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,温暖的感受 将永远留在我心里的角落{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}warm feelings, and a special place in my heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.84,0:09:56.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你永远的朋友 艾米·L·布朗博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your friend in time, Doc Emmett L. Brown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.76,0:09:59.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,1885年9月1日"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}September 1st, 1885."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.39,0:10:03.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道我还能写出如此感人的信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never knew I could write anything so touching.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.35,0:10:05.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 博士 很感人的一封信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. I know, Doc. It's beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.19,0:10:10.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别难过 哥白尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right, Copernicus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.15,0:10:11.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一切都将平安无事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything is gonna be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.44,0:10:14.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 博士 这都是我的错 害你被困在那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Doc. It's all my fault you're stuck back there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.40,0:10:15.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不该让贝夫逮到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never should've let Biff get to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.07,0:10:18.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,西部时代倒也不是最糟的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are plenty worse places to be than the Old West.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.03,0:10:20.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我有可能会跑回黑暗时代{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could have ended up in the Dark Ages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.70,0:10:21.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们可能会把我当作异教徒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They probably would have burned me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.99,0:10:24.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,绑在柱子上烧死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at the stake as a heretic or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.54,0:10:26.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们来看这地图{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's look at the map.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.20,0:10:27.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 根据图上的记载 时光旅行车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, according to this, the time vehicle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.96,0:10:30.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,被封在侧面的坑道里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is sealed off in a side tunnel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.04,0:10:32.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可能得将它炸开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We may have to blast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.77,0:10:49.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想你这一炸把死人都吵醒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you woke up the dead with that blast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.02,0:10:52.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拿着这照相机 我要将这一切都记录下来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take this camera. I want to document everything!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.11,0:10:56.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这让我想起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This reminds me of the time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.65,0:10:58.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我当年企图到地心去探险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I attempted to reach the center of the Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.07,0:11:01.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我看遍了我最喜欢的作家 儒勒凡尔纳的书{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd been reading my favorite author, Jules Verne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.70,0:11:03.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我花了几个星期来准备那次探险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I spent weeks preparing that expedition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.58,0:11:05.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而我那回甚至还走不了这么远{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't even get this far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.33,0:11:07.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但话又说回来 我当时才12岁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, I was only 12 at the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.95,0:11:11.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗? 当年就是儒勒凡尔纳所写的书{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, it was the writings of Jules Verne{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.25,0:11:13.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对我的一生造成了深远的影响{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that had a profound effect on my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.84,0:11:15.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当我11岁时 头一次读{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was when I was 11 that I first read{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.42,0:11:17.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,海底两万里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twenty Thousand Leagues Under the Sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.67,0:11:19.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我当时就下定决心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was then that I realized{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.34,0:11:22.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我得将我的一生奉献给科学{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I must devote my life to science.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.76,0:11:25.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 过来看 你看这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, check it out. Look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.98,0:11:30.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我名字的缩写!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My initials!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.60,0:11:32.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就和地心探险记一样!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like in Journey to the Center of the Earth!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.02,0:11:34.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这表示时光旅行车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That means the time machine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.11,0:11:35.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一定就在这里面!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}must be right through this wall!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.30,0:12:02.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它已经被埋在此地 达70年2个月又13天之久{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been buried in here for 70 years, two months, and 13 days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.63,0:12:03.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真不简单!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Astounding!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.05,0:12:06.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"你可以看得出来 那道闪电{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"As you see, the lightning bolt{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.14,0:12:09.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让控制时光机器的积体电路板造成了短路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}shorted out the time circuit control microchip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.35,0:12:13.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,附上的..."{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The attached..."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.52,0:12:14.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,电路图{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Schematic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.65,0:12:18.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"附上的电路图将可以让你以1955年的零件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Schematic diagram will allow you to build a replacement unit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.82,0:12:20.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,制造出一组替换的组件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with 1955 components,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.44,0:12:23.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如此将可恢复时光机器的功能"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}thus restoring the time machine to perfect working order."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.24,0:12:25.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,叫人难以相信这一小片破铜烂铁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unbelievable that this little piece of junk{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.70,0:12:27.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,竟然会造成如此严重的问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}could be such a big problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.25,0:12:31.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,难怪这玩意儿会坏掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No wonder this circuit failed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.87,0:12:33.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这上面写着"日本制造"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It says, "Made in Japan."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.00,0:12:38.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你这话是什么意思? 博士 最好的东西都是日本制的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean, Doc? All the best stuff is made in Japan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.59,0:12:41.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,叫人难以相信!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unbelievable!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.01,0:12:50.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道 当我还是个孩子时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, when I was a kid,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.52,0:12:52.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,总希望能成为一个牛仔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always wanted to be a cowboy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.69,0:12:56.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如今知道我将在过去渡过余生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now, knowing I'm gonna spend my future in the past,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.31,0:13:00.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,似乎不失为一个渡过退休后的日子的好方法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it sounds like a wonderful way to spend my retirement years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.23,0:13:03.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚想到 马丁 既然我回到了1885年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It just occurred to me, Marty, since I end up in 1885,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.19,0:13:05.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我已经是个历史人物了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}perhaps I'm now in the history books.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.36,0:13:07.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wonder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.32,0:13:09.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我如果到图书馆去 是否会在铁匠书里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could I go to the library and look myself up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.16,0:13:11.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看到关于我的消息?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the old newspaper archives?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.49,0:13:12.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不晓得 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.70,0:13:13.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你自己不是经常说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the one that's always saying, you know,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.96,0:13:15.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,人不该对自己的命运知道太多?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's not good to know too much about your own destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.04,0:13:19.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说的对 马丁 我已经知道太多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right, Marty. I know too much already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.63,0:13:20.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我还是别急着去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better that I not attempt to uncover{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.05,0:13:24.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,知道自己将来的际遇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the circumstances of my own future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.88,0:13:27.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哥白尼 来吧! 孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copernicus. Come on, boy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.39,0:13:30.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我去找他 博士 哥白尼!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get him, Doc. Copernicus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.89,0:13:34.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哥白尼 来吧 我们回家去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copernicus, come on. Let's go home, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.64,0:13:37.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哪里不对劲?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.73,0:13:41.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哪里不对劲? 哥白尼 来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong, Copernicus? Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.11,0:13:43.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 我们回家去 来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go home. Come on. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.22,0:13:47.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(艾米·布朗长眠于此)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.49,0:13:50.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到这边来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc! Doc! Come here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.66,0:13:51.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.75,0:13:57.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了? 马丁 你脸上的表情活像见了鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong, Marty? You look like you've seen a ghost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.33,0:13:59.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,差不多 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not far off, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.71,0:14:05.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great Scott!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.76,0:14:06.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听听这上面写的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check this out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.97,0:14:10.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"死于1885年9月7日"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Died September 7th, 1885."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.22,0:14:11.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是在你写那封信后一个星期啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's one week after you wrote the letter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.31,0:14:15.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"挚爱的克蕾拉在此立碑 献上永恒的哀思"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Erected in eternal memory by his beloved Clara."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.02,0:14:17.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁是克蕾拉?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who the hell is Clara?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.60,0:14:19.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 拜托别挡在那里!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, please don't stand there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.48,0:14:21.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! Right. Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.11,0:14:23.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我得再照一张相{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta get another picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.44,0:14:28.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"为了八十块钱 被贝夫·添南从背后射杀"?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Shot in the back by Buford Tannen over a matter of $80"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.11,0:14:31.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这算是哪门子的未来啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of a future do you call that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.41,0:14:34.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"贝夫·添南是个声名狼藉的枪手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Buford Tannen was a notorious gunman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.95,0:14:37.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他的坏脾气和流口水的毛病{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whose short temper and a tendency to drool{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.79,0:14:39.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为他赢得了疯狗的外号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}earned him the nickname Mad Dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.79,0:14:41.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他拔枪的速度很快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was quick on the trigger{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.13,0:14:43.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吹嘘自己杀过12个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and bragged that he had killed 12 men{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.42,0:14:45.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还不包括印第安人或中国人在内"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not including Indians or Chinamen."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.30,0:14:47.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有提到我吗? 我是那12个人中的一个?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does it mention me? Am I one of the 12?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.09,0:14:48.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.22,0:14:50.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"但这说法无法得到证实{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"However this claim cannot be substantiated,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.09,0:14:51.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为在1884年添南射杀了一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}since precise records were not kept{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.89,0:14:53.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,写了一篇不利于他的文章的报社编辑后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after Tannen shot a newspaper editor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.64,0:14:56.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就再也无法保存正确的记录"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who printed an unfavorable story about him in 1884."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.56,0:14:57.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,难怪我们什么也找不到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why we can't find anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.64,0:14:58.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.23,0:15:03.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威廉·麦佛莱全家合照 是你的亲戚?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}William McFly and family. Your relatives?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.19,0:15:05.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的曾祖父是叫威廉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My great-grandfather's name was William.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.82,0:15:08.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是他 长得蛮帅的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's him. Good-looking guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.41,0:15:12.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有麦佛莱家的记载 却没有姓布朗的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}McFlys, but no Browns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.82,0:15:13.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我们弄错了 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, maybe it was a mistake, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.91,0:15:14.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或许那不是你的坟墓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe that grave wasn't yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.08,0:15:17.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那可能是1885年时的另一个艾米·布朗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There could've been another Emmett Brown back in 1885.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.45,0:15:18.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.54,0:15:19.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,镇上那时有你们家的亲戚吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you have any relatives here back then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.71,0:15:21.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,布朗家1908年才搬来希尔谷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Browns didn't come to Hill Valley until 1908.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.83,0:15:23.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且他们当时是姓逢·布朗斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then they were the von Brauns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.50,0:15:26.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我父亲在第一次大战时改了名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father changed our name during the First World War.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.13,0:15:27.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 你看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.55,0:15:32.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天 是我啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great Scott, it's me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.64,0:15:35.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么这一切全都是真的了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then it is true, all of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.64,0:15:39.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我确实回到了那时代而且被枪杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is me who goes back there and gets shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.14,0:15:41.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是不会发生的 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not gonna happen, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.64,0:15:43.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在你修好时光器回路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After you fix the time circuits{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.31,0:15:44.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,并给德罗林车装上新轮胎后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and put new tires on the DeLorean,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.90,0:15:48.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就要回到1885年 把你带回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going back to 1885, and I'm bringing you home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.91,0:16:01.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,衣服还合身吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The clothes fit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.87,0:16:05.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,除了靴子外都还可以 博士 靴子紧了点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, everything except the boots, Doc. They're kind of tight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.46,0:16:07.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定这些服饰都合乎史实吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. Are you sure this stuff is authentic?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.88,0:16:11.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然了 你难道没看过西部电影?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course. Haven't you ever seen a Western?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.05,0:16:14.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 我看过 博土{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I have, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.26,0:16:17.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克林特·伊斯特伍德可不会穿上这种怪衣服{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clint Eastwood never wore anything like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.39,0:16:20.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克林谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clint who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.10,0:16:22.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 你还没听过他的大名{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right. You haven't heard of him yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.19,0:16:24.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 你得穿上这只靴子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, you have to wear the boots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.10,0:16:26.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能穿这种未来派的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't wear those futuristic things back in 1885.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.90,0:16:28.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你甚至不该在1955年穿这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shouldn't even be wearing them here in 1955.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.82,0:16:30.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 博士 我保证一到那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Doc. Look, as soon as I get there,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.11,0:16:31.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就把它们穿上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll put them on. I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.40,0:16:32.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 我想一切都就绪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. I think we're about ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.07,0:16:34.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经把油箱加满{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I put gas in the tank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.49,0:16:35.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在未来穿的衣服也已打包好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your future clothes are packed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.07,0:16:39.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为了预防万一 我还替你的对讲机换上了新电池{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just in case, fresh batteries for your walkie-talkies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.24,0:16:42.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对了 那个能飘浮的装置呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! What about that floating device?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.83,0:16:44.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,飞行滑板{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hoverboard. All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.92,0:16:48.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 从这里回希尔谷市{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Doc, it's gonna be a hell of a long walk{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.63,0:16:50.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,得走很久啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}back to Hill Valley from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.42,0:16:51.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但这是最安全的计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's still the safest plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.80,0:16:54.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能把你送回人口众多的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After all, we can't risk sending you back into a populated area{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.59,0:16:56.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或是某个地理学上的不明地带{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or to a spot that's geographically unknown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.93,0:16:58.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你该不会想撞上一棵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't want to crash into some tree{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.60,0:17:00.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,曾经存在过的树吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that once existed in the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.39,0:17:02.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是一大片开阔地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was all completely open country,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.93,0:17:05.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当你抵达后将会有足够的空间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so you'll have plenty of run out space when you arrive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.65,0:17:08.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,记住 你要去的地方是没有路的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember, where you're going, there are no roads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.86,0:17:10.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那边有个小山洞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a small cave over there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.11,0:17:12.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是个隐藏时光旅行车的好地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which will be a perfect place to hide the time vehicle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.57,0:17:16.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,新的时光机器所装的真空管已经先暖过机了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the new time circuit control tubes are warmed up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.28,0:17:21.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,时光旅行回路启动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time circuits on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.16,0:17:22.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是在9月1日写那封信的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wrote the letter on September 1st,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.41,0:17:24.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我送你回去第二天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so we'll send you back the very next day,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.12,0:17:25.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也就是9月2日 那天是星期{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}September 2nd. That's a Wednesday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.21,0:17:27.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,1885年9月2日 早上8点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}September 2nd, 1885, 8:00 a.m.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.96,0:17:29.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是在7号星期一那天被射杀的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I get shot on Monday the 7th,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.29,0:17:30.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你将有五天的时间来找我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so you have five days to locate me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.71,0:17:31.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我那封信上说我是铁匠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}According to my letter, I'm a blacksmith,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.05,0:17:34.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我可能会拥有一间打铁铺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I probably have a shop somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.72,0:17:36.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你只要将时光旅行车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All you have to do is drive the time vehicle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.80,0:17:38.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,朝那银幕开过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}directly toward that screen,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.22,0:17:40.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,并加速到每小时88英里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}accelerating to 88 miles an hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.43,0:17:43.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,慢着 博士 如果我朝那银幕开过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. Doc, if I drive straight towards the screen,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.52,0:17:45.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,会撞上那些印第安人的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna crash into those Indians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.14,0:17:48.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 你没有以四度空间的角度来思考{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, you're not thinking fourth-dimensionally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.56,0:17:50.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你到时候将会回到1885年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll instantly be transported to 1885,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.82,0:17:52.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那些印第安人的画像不会在那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and those Indians won't even be there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.15,0:17:56.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 那么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. Well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.74,0:18:00.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为了我们两个 祝你好运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck for both of our sakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.49,0:18:01.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在未来见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you in the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.91,0:18:03.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说过去?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.00,0:18:05.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,正是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.84,0:18:13.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一路顺风! 马丁!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happy trails, Marty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.43,0:18:20.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了? 马丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready, Marty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.85,0:18:23.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.68,0:18:24.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,预备!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Set!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.97,0:18:26.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,加油 银马{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi-ho, Silver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.55,0:19:05.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,印第安人!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indians!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.18,0:19:45.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是那个山洞!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cave!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.55,0:20:21.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,冲锋!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.01,0:20:27.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼 骑兵队!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit! The cavalry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.27,0:21:20.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该死! 我把油管弄破了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn, I ripped the fuel line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.36,0:22:09.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,麦姬 打些水来 这边有个人受伤了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maggie! Fetch some water! We got a hurt man here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.50,0:22:20.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈 是你吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom! Mom, is that you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.17,0:22:21.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There, there now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.42,0:22:24.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你已经昏睡了将近六个钟头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been asleep for nearly six hours now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.84,0:22:27.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我做了一个好可怕的梦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had this horrible nightmare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.84,0:22:32.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我..我梦见我在西部{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I dreamed... I dreamed I was in a Western.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.85,0:22:40.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我被一大群印第安人追赶 还有一头熊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was being chased by all these Indians and a bear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.31,0:22:41.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你现在在麦佛莱农场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you're safe and sound{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.86,0:22:43.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是很平安的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}here now at the McFly farm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.53,0:22:46.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,麦佛莱农场?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}McFly farm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.41,0:22:52.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是我的... 你是我的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you're my... You're my, my...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.66,0:22:55.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.87,0:22:58.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我姓麦佛莱 麦姬·麦佛莱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The name is McFly. Maggie McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.58,0:23:02.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,麦佛莱? 麦姬?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}McFly. Maggie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.50,0:23:05.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是麦佛莱太太 别遗漏太太这个称呼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's Mrs. McFly, and don't you be forgetting the Mrs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.76,0:23:07.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你又是叫什么名字? 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what might your name be, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.13,0:23:08.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我姓麦...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.51,0:23:13.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伊斯特伍德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eastwood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.64,0:23:17.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克林特·伊斯特伍德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clint Eastwood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.27,0:23:20.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的头撞伤了 伊斯特伍德先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you hit your head, Mr. Eastwood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.14,0:23:21.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然不严重 但算你运气好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not too serious, but lucky for you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.85,0:23:23.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢穆斯发现了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seamus found you when he did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.98,0:23:25.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢穆斯?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seamus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.82,0:23:27.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我丈夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.99,0:23:33.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,恕我失陪了 伊斯特伍德先生 我得去看威廉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be excusing me, Mr. Eastwood, while I tend to William.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.24,0:23:34.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威廉?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}William.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.49,0:23:37.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要紧 威廉 不要紧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that's okay, Will. It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.21,0:23:46.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他就是威廉?  - 对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's William? - Aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.30,0:23:49.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威廉·西恩·麦佛莱 我们这个家族在美国出生的第一代{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}William Sean McFly, the first of our family to be born in America.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.84,0:23:52.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要紧 威尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay, Will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.30,0:23:55.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这位客人是克林特·伊斯特伍德先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This here is Mr. Clint Eastwood here visiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.97,0:23:58.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他很喜欢你呢! 伊斯特伍德先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He surely likes you, Mr. Eastwood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.02,0:24:00.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,麦姬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maggie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.60,0:24:03.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我猎到了晚餐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got supper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.85,0:24:06.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是想打探你的隐私{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not one to pry into a man's personal affairs,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.57,0:24:10.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是如何来到这偏僻的地方?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but exactly how is it that you came to be way out here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.07,0:24:15.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你既没有马 也没有靴子和帽子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without a horse, or boots, or a hat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.49,0:24:17.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的车...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, my car...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.79,0:24:20.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的马病了 而且 一头熊把我的靴子吃了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Horse broke down, and a bear ate my boots,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.00,0:24:22.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,至于帽子 我想我是忘了拿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I guess I just forgot my hat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.96,0:24:25.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎能忘掉帽子这么重要的东西?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could you forget a thing like your hat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.84,0:24:27.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要点水吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like some water?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.13,0:24:28.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.14,0:24:41.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我看这样好了 伊斯特伍德先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell you what I'll do, Mr. Eastwood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.56,0:24:43.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会帮你找到你那位铁匠朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll help you find your blacksmith friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.23,0:24:48.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你今晚可以睡在谷仓里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can stay the night in the barn,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.40,0:24:51.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,明天我带你到铁路那边去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and tomorrow I'll take you as far as the railroad tracks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.65,0:24:53.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以顺着它走到镇上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can follow them straight on into town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.95,0:24:58.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我甚至可以送你一顶帽子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll even give you a hat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.95,0:25:03.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这真是太好了 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's great. Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.38,0:25:09.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的威廉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my William.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.43,0:25:17.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.51,0:25:21.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想你会觉得谷仓够舒服的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you'll find the barn comfortable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.18,0:25:24.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我养的猪可从没抱怨过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never had any complaints about it from the pigs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.19,0:25:26.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢穆斯!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seamus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.27,0:25:27.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,借一步说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A word with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.44,0:25:28.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.15,0:25:34.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帮我抱他一下好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you hold him for a minute?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.28,0:25:40.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定你这么做妥当吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure you're not after bringing a curse on this house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.62,0:25:42.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,随便收留一个陌生人?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}taking him in like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.91,0:25:44.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是个很古怪的年轻人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's such a strange young man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.41,0:25:47.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对 但我对他有种奇怪的感觉 麦姬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye. But I've just got a feeling about him, Maggie,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.46,0:25:50.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我觉得照顾他是应该的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that looking after him is the right thing to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.25,0:25:51.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这点是很重要的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That it's important.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.75,0:25:53.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你好 兄弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.51,0:25:55.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你看这孩子跟他处得多好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look how the baby takes to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.72,0:25:59.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小威尔一向不喜欢陌生人的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little Will never takes to strangers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.47,0:26:02.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就好像 他跟我们有某种渊源似的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's almost as if he's connected to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.47,0:26:03.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.10,0:26:06.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,原来你就是我的曾祖父{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're my great-grandfather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.85,0:26:09.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,麦佛莱家族在美国出生的第一代{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The first McFly born in America.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.99,0:26:16.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且你还尿在我的身上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you peed on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.68,0:26:43.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(山谷镇)
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.71,0:27:08.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给我肥皂 法兰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give us some soap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.00,0:27:10.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拿去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.16,0:28:06.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.21,0:28:10.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(出差到海斯维尔执行臭罗麦克斯的绞刑)
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.31,0:28:59.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看看谁进来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a look and see what just breezed in the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.86,0:29:05.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不晓得马戏团到镇上来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, I didn't know the circus was in town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.45,0:29:08.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这件衬衫八成是从一个死中国人身上剥下来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must have got that shirt off a dead Chinese.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.10,0:29:30.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要些什么? 陌生人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What will it be, stranger?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.27,0:29:36.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要一杯冰水{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll have ice water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.98,0:29:38.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,冰水?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ice water?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.69,0:29:40.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,冰水?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Water?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.77,0:29:42.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,冰水? 你如果要喝水{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want water, you better go dunk your head{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.94,0:29:45.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到外面的马槽就有了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the horse trough out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.61,0:29:48.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在这里 我们供应威士忌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In here, we pour whiskey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.50,0:30:00.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.84,0:30:02.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.13,0:30:04.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在找一位铁匠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying to find the blacksmith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.59,0:30:07.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,麦佛莱!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, McFly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.05,0:30:11.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是告诉过你别到这...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thought I done told you never to come in...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.56,0:30:15.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是谢穆斯·麦佛莱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ain't Seamus McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.06,0:30:18.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但你长得蛮像他的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look like him, though,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.81,0:30:20.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,特别是配上那顶丑帽子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}especially with that dog-ugly hat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.73,0:30:26.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是那土包子的亲戚吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You kin to that hay barber?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.15,0:30:27.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你叫什么名字? 小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your name, dude?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.03,0:30:29.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.45,0:30:31.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伊斯特伍德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eastwood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.20,0:30:34.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克林特·伊斯特伍德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clint Eastwood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.58,0:30:38.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是哪门子的名字啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of stupid name is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.00,0:30:41.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我看他是畜栏跑出来的小畜生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd say he's the runt of the litter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.17,0:30:43.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看 兄弟们 看见他这些白牙齿没?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, now, boys, would you take a look-see at these pearly whites?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.88,0:30:45.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,除了买来的假牙 我还没见过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell, I ain't seen teeth look that straight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.26,0:30:46.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这么白的牙齿呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that weren't store-bought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.38,0:30:48.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看他穿的平底鞋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a gander at them moccasins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.43,0:30:49.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么样的皮做的啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of skins is them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.01,0:30:51.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那上面写的字是什么意思?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that writing mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.18,0:30:52.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,耐克? 这是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Nike"? What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.60,0:30:54.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,印第安土话?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some sort of Injun talk or something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.43,0:31:01.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,酒保 我在找那个骗人的铁匠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bartender, I'm looking for that no-good, cheating blacksmith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.15,0:31:02.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你有看到他吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seen him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.56,0:31:04.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有 添南先生 我没看见他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sir, Mr. Tannen. I have not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.90,0:31:07.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,添南{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tannen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.11,0:31:09.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你就是疯狗添南{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're "Mad Dog" Tannen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.83,0:31:17.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,疯狗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Mad Dog"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.70,0:31:19.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我痛恨这名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate that name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.04,0:31:22.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我痛恨它 你听见了没?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate it, you hear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.75,0:31:25.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁也不能叫我疯狗!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody calls me "Mad Dog"!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.71,0:31:29.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,特别是你这种没用的窝囊废{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Especially not some duded-up, egg-sucking gutter trash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.80,0:31:33.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给我跳舞!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.76,0:31:34.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给我跳!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.10,0:31:40.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给我跳! 小鬼 你可以跳得更好!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, runt! You can dance better than that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.28,0:31:51.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.18,0:32:14.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你最好快逃命 小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better run, squirrel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.85,0:32:16.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把他抓起来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.91,0:33:22.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们盖了一栋新的法院{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got ourselves a new courthouse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.87,0:33:24.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,正好趁这机会执行绞刑!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}High time we had a hanging!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.59,0:33:28.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.48,0:33:46.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看他在那里摇摆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at him swing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.65,0:33:52.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 这镇上好久没吊过人了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, haven't had a hanging in a long time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.15,0:33:59.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以在五百码外射中一只狗身上的虫子 添南{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll shoot the fleas off a dog's back at 500 yards, Tannen,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.57,0:34:01.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在就瞄准着你的脑袋!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it's pointed straight at your head!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.09,0:34:13.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你欠我钱 打铁的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You owe me money, blacksmith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.63,0:34:15.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这话怎么说?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you figure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.13,0:34:16.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的马掉了一只马蹄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My horse threw a shoe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.84,0:34:18.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,既然当初是你替它钉的马蹄铁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And seeing as you was the one that done the shoeing,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.47,0:34:19.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你就得负责{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say that makes you responsible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.93,0:34:23.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,反正你也一直没付我工钱 我们顶多互不相欠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, since you never paid me for the job, I say that makes us even.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.97,0:34:26.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当我的马掉了马蹄时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wrong! See I was on my horse{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.14,0:34:27.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我正骑着它 你害我跌下马!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when it threw the shoe, and I got throwed off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.94,0:34:30.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,跌破一瓶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that caused me to bust a perfectly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.15,0:34:32.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,上好的肯塔基红眼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}good bottle of fine Kentucky red eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.65,0:34:34.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以在我算来 打铁的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So the way I figure it, blacksmith,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.61,0:34:36.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你得赔我五块威士忌的钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you owe me $5 for the whiskey{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.57,0:34:38.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再加上75块钱赔那匹马!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and $75 for the horse!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.66,0:34:40.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,正好是八十块{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the $80.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.82,0:34:43.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 如果你的马掉了马蹄铁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, if your horse threw a shoe,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.37,0:34:45.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把它带来 我再帮它钉一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}bring him back, and I'll reshoe him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.33,0:34:46.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经射死那匹马了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I done shot that horse!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.04,0:34:49.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是你家的事 添南{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's your problem, Tannen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.33,0:34:52.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,错了 该担心的是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wrong. That's yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.46,0:34:56.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从现在起 你在走路时最好留意你背后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So from now on, you better be looking behind you when you walk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.21,0:34:58.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为有天你的背上将会挨颗子弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because one day you're gonna get a bullet in your back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.85,0:35:09.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.90,0:35:15.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 我已经清楚地告诉你别来这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, I gave you explicit instructions not to come here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.11,0:35:17.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要你直接回1985年去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but to go directly back to 1985.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.36,0:35:20.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 博士 但我非来不可{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, Doc, but I had to come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.86,0:35:23.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我还是很高兴能见到你 马丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's good to see you, Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.54,0:35:29.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 你得换掉这身衣服才行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, you're gonna have to do something about those clothes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.58,0:35:30.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你如果这样在镇上到处走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You walk around town dressed like that,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.04,0:35:32.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你会挨子弹的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're liable to get shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.67,0:35:33.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或者被吊死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or hanged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.71,0:35:36.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是哪个白痴给你穿这身衣服的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What idiot dressed you in that outfit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.92,0:35:38.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.05,0:35:43.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"为了八十块钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Shot in the back by Buford Tannen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.68,0:35:45.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,被贝夫添南在背后射杀?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}over a matter of $80,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.81,0:35:47.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,9月7号"?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}September 7"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.06,0:35:50.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这不就是下个星期一吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's this Monday!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.14,0:35:52.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如今我倒希望我赔给他那些钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I wish I'd paid him off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.73,0:35:54.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个挚爱的克蕾拉是谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And who's this beloved Clara?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.56,0:35:56.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不认识任何姓克蕾拉的啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know anyone named Clara.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.94,0:35:59.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不晓得 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.82,0:36:01.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为她是你的女朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought maybe she was a girlfriend of yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.07,0:36:07.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 我回到1885年 并接触这个时代的人和物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, my involvement in such a social relationship here in 1885{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.41,0:36:11.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,已经可能对时空的连续性带来毁灭性的后果了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}could result in a disruption of the space-time continuum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.41,0:36:15.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,身为一个科学家 我是绝不可能冒这种险的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As a scientist, I can never take that risk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.09,0:36:19.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,特别是在我们经历了这一切之后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Certainly not after what we've already been through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.71,0:36:20.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾米!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emmett!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.92,0:36:22.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾米{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Emmett.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.18,0:36:23.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,休伯特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hubert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.84,0:36:25.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是市长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the mayor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.14,0:36:27.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,打扰一下 艾米{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, Emmett.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.43,0:36:30.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还记得在上星期的镇民大会上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you remember last week at the town meeting when you volunteered{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.18,0:36:31.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你志愿到车站去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to meet the new schoolteacher{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.60,0:36:32.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,迎接新到任的老师吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at the station when she came in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.73,0:36:33.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 我还记得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes, quite so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.77,0:36:36.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们刚接到消息 她明天会到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we just got word she's coming in tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.31,0:36:38.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是详细内容{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here are the details for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.36,0:36:39.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,多谢你的热心协助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for all your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.90,0:36:41.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不客气 休伯特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anytime, Hubert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.90,0:36:45.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她的名字叫克雷顿小姐 克蕾拉·克雷顿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! Her name's Miss Clayton. Clara Clayton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.46,0:36:58.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 现在我知道克蕾拉是谁了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Doc, now we know who Clara is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.38,0:37:02.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 这是不可能发生的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, it's impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.67,0:37:05.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这种我跟她会一见钟情的说法 根本就是浪漫派的鬼话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The idea that I could fall in love at first sight is romantic nonsense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.14,0:37:09.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这种事根本没有科学理论根据{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no scientific rationale for that concept.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.47,0:37:11.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样 博士 这又不是科学{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw, come on, Doc. It's not science.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.56,0:37:14.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当你遇上了情投意合的女孩时 会像是被雷击中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You meet the right girl, it just hits you. It's like lightning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.14,0:37:15.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 拜托你 别再说了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, please don't say that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.81,0:37:18.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我和詹妮弗的情形就是这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the way it was for me and Jennifer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.48,0:37:21.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们甚至无法将眼睛从对方的身上移开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, we couldn't keep our eyes off each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.53,0:37:23.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老天 詹妮弗 该死的 希望她没事 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, Jennifer, damn. I hope she's all right, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.65,0:37:25.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不敢相信我们就这样把她丢在那门廊上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe we just left her there on the porch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.07,0:37:28.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心 马丁 她不会有事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, Marty. She'll be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.16,0:37:30.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当你在1955年把那本年鉴烧掉后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you burned the almanac in 1955,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.33,0:37:31.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,接下来的历史也都恢复正常了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the normal timeline was restored.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.00,0:37:33.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这表示当我们回到1985年时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That means once we're back in 1985,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.83,0:37:35.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你只需要到她家去叫醒她就行了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you just have to go over to her house to wake her up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.71,0:37:40.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 到那活塞那边去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Marty, turn that valve over there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.09,0:37:41.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,向右转到底{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all the way to the right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.21,0:37:43.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对 转到底{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, pull it all the way around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.17,0:37:44.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 开始了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.86,0:38:00.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要来杯冰茶吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Iced tea?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.48,0:38:01.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.44,0:38:04.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是个冰箱啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a refrigerator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.40,0:38:06.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看样子克雷顿小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I guess Miss Clayton{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.20,0:38:08.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,得另外找别的交通工具了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will have to find other transportation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.20,0:38:09.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我根本没碰上那女人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I never meet the woman,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.28,0:38:11.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就不可能跟她谈恋爱 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there's no possibility of a romantic infatuation, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.53,0:38:13.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 全听你的 博士 - 好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're the doc, Doc. - All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.50,0:38:16.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们去取回德罗林跑车然后回到未来去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll get the DeLorean and get ourselves back to the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.12,0:38:17.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对了 博士 我在抵达时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, listen, Doc, I tore a hole{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.54,0:38:18.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把油箱弄破了一个洞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the gas tank when I was landing,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.79,0:38:21.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得把洞补起来再把油加满{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so we're gonna have to patch it up and get some gas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.46,0:38:23.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说那车里没有油了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean we're out of gas?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.84,0:38:24.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 但没什么大不了的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it's no big deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.92,0:38:26.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是还有核融合反应器吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got Mr. Fusion, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.63,0:38:30.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,核融合反应器提供时光旅行仪以及通量电容器的电力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Fusion powers the time circuits and the Flux Capacitor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.55,0:38:33.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但内燃机却始终都是靠汽油做为动力的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the internal combustion engine runs on ordinary gasoline.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.56,0:38:35.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一直都是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It always has.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.39,0:38:37.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这一带要到下个世纪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's not gonna be a gas station around here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.44,0:38:40.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,才会有加油站的设立{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until sometime in the next century.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.15,0:38:41.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,若是没有汽油{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without gasoline,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.90,0:38:45.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是无法将德罗林跑车推进到每小时88英里的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we can't get the DeLorean up to 88 miles per hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.61,0:38:49.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在该怎么办?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what do we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.50,0:39:01.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,24里!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twenty-four!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.17,0:39:02.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是没有用的! 马丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's no use, Marty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.79,0:39:05.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,即使是世界上最快的马{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even the fastest horse in the world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.09,0:39:07.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,时速顶多只有35或40英里!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}won't run more than 35, 40 miles an hour!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.44,0:39:21.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,酒保说这是他们最烈的酒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bartender said that's the strongest stuff they got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.69,0:39:23.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,启动试试 马丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try it, Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.49,0:39:36.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再加些油!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give it more gas!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.59,0:39:46.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该死!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.80,0:39:51.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我把喷射油管弄坏了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It blew the fuel injection manifold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.47,0:39:53.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那玩意儿确实有够烈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strong stuff, all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.47,0:39:56.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我得花一个月才能将它修好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will take me a month to rebuild it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.47,0:39:57.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个月?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A month?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.18,0:39:59.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 你星期一就要被杀了啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, you're gonna get shot on Monday!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.06,0:40:03.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 我知道 我只希望...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know! I know! I know! I wish...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.69,0:40:08.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,慢着 我有办法了 我们可以将它从险坡上开下去!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. I've got it! We can simply roll it down a steep hill!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.49,0:40:10.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不行 我们找不到够平的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! We'd never find a smooth enough surface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.49,0:40:11.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,除非...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.57,0:40:13.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,地面结冰!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course! Ice!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.62,0:40:15.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们等到冬天 等湖面结冰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll wait until winter when the lake freezes over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.91,0:40:17.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,冬天? 博士 你在说什么啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Winter? Doc, what are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.74,0:40:19.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再三天就是星期一了好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monday! It's three days away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.29,0:40:20.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, all right, all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.33,0:40:23.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我以逻辑的方法来想这件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just let's think this thing through logically.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.67,0:40:25.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们已知道它无法以本身的动力前进{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know it won't run under its own power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.50,0:40:27.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也知道无法用马来拖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know we can't pull it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.46,0:40:30.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但 如果我们能想出一个办法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if we could figure out a way{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.01,0:40:34.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,将它推进到每小时88里的速度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to push it up to 88 miles an hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.81,0:40:44.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.98,0:40:48.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它能跑多快? 我自己就曾将它开到过55{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How fast can she go? Why, I've had her up to 55 myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.03,0:40:52.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我听说无畏的法兰克·法戈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard that Fearless Frank Fargo{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.11,0:40:53.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在车子开过维迪换车站之后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}got one of these up to near 70{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.53,0:40:55.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,曾开到将近70里的速度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}out past Verde Junction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.41,0:40:58.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你认为有可能将它开到90里吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think it's possible to get it up to 90?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.16,0:40:59.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,90里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ninety?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.49,0:41:02.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天 老弟 有谁会这么急啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tarnation, son, who'd ever need to be in such a hurry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.37,0:41:04.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟他只是在打个赌罢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just a little bet he and I have, that's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.71,0:41:07.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在理论上来说 这办得到吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Theoretically speaking, could it be done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.29,0:41:09.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想你若是开在平原上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I suppose, if you had a straight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.21,0:41:11.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且是直的铁轨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}stretch of track with a level grade,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.13,0:41:13.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且后面都没有拖着车厢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you weren't hauling no cars behind you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.68,0:41:15.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还能够将蒸汽锅炉烧得够热{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and if you could get the fire hot enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.55,0:41:19.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是指那种比炼狱之中还要热的热度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm talking about hotter than the blazes of hell and damnation itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.60,0:41:21.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这一来它就有可能达到这速度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then yes, sir, it might be possible to get her up that fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.89,0:41:23.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,下一班火车何时会经过此地?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me, when does the next train come through here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.06,0:41:25.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,星期一早上八点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monday morning at 8:00.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.56,0:41:28.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这里! 这条由主线分出的支线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here. This spur that runs off the main line{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.23,0:41:29.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在到达克雷顿峡谷前有三里的路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}three miles out to Clayton Ravine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.82,0:41:31.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是一条平坦笔直的铁轨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a long stretch of level track{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.44,0:41:33.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且在1985年时仍然存在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that will still exist in 1985.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.86,0:41:37.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们将在此地用火车头来推德罗林跑车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is where we'll push the DeLorean with the locomotive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.41,0:41:40.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,奇怪的是 这张地图上把克雷顿峡谷 叫做修那许峡谷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Funny. This map calls Clayton Ravine Shonash Ravine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.04,0:41:44.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这八成是它以前的印第安旧名字 再完美不过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That must be the old Indian name for it. It's perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.25,0:41:46.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一条长长的直铁轨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A nice long run that goes clear across{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.12,0:41:47.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,直通到峡谷上头的铁桥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the bridge over the ravine,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.25,0:41:49.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道 靠近希尔戴尔社区一带{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you know, over near that Hilldale housing development.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.67,0:41:54.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 博士 但根据这份地图上的记载 那里没有桥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, Doc, but according to this map, there is no bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.63,0:41:58.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 我们可以打消那个主意了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Doc, we can scratch that idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.26,0:41:59.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能等上一年半载{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, we can't wait a year and a half{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.68,0:42:00.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等这座桥完成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for this thing to get finished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.81,0:42:02.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 这是完美的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, it's perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.31,0:42:04.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你只是没有以四度空间来思考{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're just not thinking fourth-dimensionally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.52,0:42:06.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 我在这方面确实比较不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. Right. I have a real problem with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.31,0:42:10.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还不明白吗 这座桥在1985年是存在的啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you see? The bridge will exist in 1985.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.27,0:42:12.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不但安全牢固 而且还在使用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's safe and still in use.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.23,0:42:15.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因此 只要我们能在到达峡谷前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Therefore, as long as we get the DeLorean up to 88 miles an hour{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.11,0:42:16.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,将德罗林跑车推进到88英里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before we hit the edge of the ravine,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.91,0:42:19.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就会在一瞬间到达{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we'll instantaneously arrive at a point in time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.45,0:42:21.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那座桥已经完成的年代{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where the bridge is completed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.66,0:42:27.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,车子底下将会有铁轨 然后安全地滑过峡谷的上空{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll have track under us and coast safely across the ravine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.29,0:42:28.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那个火车头呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the locomotive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.54,0:42:30.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它将会在峡谷底下撞个稀烂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will be a spectacular wreck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.63,0:42:32.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可惜到时候将没有人看见这一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too bad no one will be around to see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.34,0:42:36.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,救命啊! 救命!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me! Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.30,0:42:37.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great Scott!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.29,0:43:20.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来! 这边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.18,0:43:21.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.39,0:43:24.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,跳上来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jump!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.49,0:43:42.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 先生 你救了我的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, sir. You saved my...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.45,0:43:45.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.87,0:43:52.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾米·布朗在此听候差遣 小姐是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emmett Brown at your service, Miss...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.75,0:43:57.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克雷顿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clayton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.72,0:43:59.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克蕾拉·克雷顿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clara Clayton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.22,0:44:02.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克蕾拉!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clara!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.06,0:44:07.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好美的名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a beautiful name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.24,0:44:27.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我能帮你把行李搬进去吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I help you inside with these?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.99,0:44:30.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不用了 我自己来就可以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, that won't be necessary. I can take care of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.79,0:44:33.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你已经帮了我很多忙了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've done more than enough already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.37,0:44:35.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但这真的一点也不麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's really no trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.21,0:44:37.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 她说不用了 我们该走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, she says it's fine, and we got to get going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.67,0:44:41.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小姐 祝你教学顺利 一切平安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ma'am, good luck with your school teaching and everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.51,0:44:44.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克蕾拉 我会去找史戴勒先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clara, I'll straighten everything out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.59,0:44:46.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,解释那辆出租马车损毁的经过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with Mr. Statler for the buckboard rental.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.47,0:44:47.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不必担心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.89,0:44:49.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得在某方面来说 我该对此事负责{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel somewhat responsible for what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.93,0:44:55.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你这么做真是绅士的风度 布朗先生 艾米{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That would be very gentlemanly of you, Mr. Brown. Emmett.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.57,0:45:01.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗? 我得感谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I'm almost glad{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.11,0:45:02.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那条蛇吓到了马{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that snake spooked those horses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.57,0:45:05.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,否则我们可能永远不会认识{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Otherwise, we might never have met.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.57,0:45:07.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想这一切都是缘份吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose it was destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.62,0:45:12.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么 谢谢你帮了这么多忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, thank you for everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.21,0:45:15.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请别客气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're quite welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.42,0:45:20.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还会再见到你 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will see you again, won't I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.13,0:45:21.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然 我相信你会经常见到我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course. You'll see lots of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.46,0:45:22.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我肯定 我在镇上有个店{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure. I have a shop in town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.01,0:45:25.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是本地的科学家 铁匠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the local scientist, blacksmith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.55,0:45:29.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,科学? 哪方面的科学{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Science? What sort of science?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.39,0:45:31.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天文学? 化学?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Astronomy? Chemistry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.60,0:45:34.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上 我研究各方面的科学{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, I'm a student of all sciences.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.14,0:45:37.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 我们得走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Doc, we got to get going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.27,0:45:40.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 那么 恕我们失陪了 克蕾拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes. Well, excuse us, Clara.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.32,0:45:42.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得...走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to get going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.74,0:45:47.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toodle-oo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.21,0:45:58.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说你会经常见到她是什么意思 博士?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean, you're gonna be seeing lots of her, Doc?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.25,0:46:01.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我改天可能会顺路来看看她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I might see her again just in passing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.50,0:46:03.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,少来了 博士 你有看见她看着你的眼神吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Doc. Did you see the way she was looking at you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.59,0:46:08.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她刚刚受了很大的惊吓 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She did have quite a scare, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.76,0:46:10.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎样 这位克雷顿小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After all, Miss Clayton almost ended up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.30,0:46:12.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,差点就摔死在克雷顿峡谷底呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at the bottom of Clayton Ravine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.31,0:46:13.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克雷顿峡谷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clayton Ravine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.35,0:46:18.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天! 博士 克雷顿峡谷是以一个教师的名字命名的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit. Hey, Doc, Clayton Ravine was named after a teacher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.56,0:46:20.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们说她是在一百年前跌下那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say she fell in there 100 years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.61,0:46:23.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一百年前? 那就是今年啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}100 years ago! That's this year!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.53,0:46:24.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,学校里每个人都知道这故事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every kid in school knows that story,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.86,0:46:25.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们心目中总会希望某个老师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'cause we all have teachers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.90,0:46:27.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也摔到峡谷里去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we'd like to see fall into the ravine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.99,0:46:29.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great Scott!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.83,0:46:34.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么她是应该跟着那马车一起跌下去的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then she was supposed to go over in that wagon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.20,0:46:38.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这下子我可能已经严重地改变了历史{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I may have seriously altered history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.21,0:46:42.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 博士 最坏的情况是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Doc, what's the worst that can happen, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.34,0:46:44.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,顶多不以她的名字替那峡谷命名{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So they don't name the ravine after her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.80,0:46:45.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还是快把德罗林车弄好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just get the DeLorean ready{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.01,0:46:47.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,离开这地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and get the hell out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.22,0:46:50.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我真希望我从来没有发明那不祥的时光机器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish I'd never invented that infernal time machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.01,0:46:54.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它只会带来灾难而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's caused nothing but disaster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.39,0:46:59.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 这是马丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, Doc, this is Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.73,0:47:00.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你听见了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you read me? Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.90,0:47:01.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题 马丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check, Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.02,0:47:04.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好极了 博士 它们仍然能用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great, Doc. These things still work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.48,0:47:05.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 马丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.99,0:47:09.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们再把全部的计划演练一遍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once more, let's go over the entire plan and layout.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.53,0:47:11.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉 这模型做得太简陋...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I apologize for the crudity of this model, but I just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.62,0:47:14.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 博士 它不合比例 没有关系 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I know, Doc. It's not to scale. It's okay, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.70,0:47:18.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 明天晚上 星期天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Tomorrow night, Sunday,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.25,0:47:21.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们将把德罗林跑车 放在铁路支线的这地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we'll load the DeLorean onto the tracks here, on the spur{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.21,0:47:23.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就在这废弃的旧银矿旁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}right by the old abandoned silver mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.59,0:47:26.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个转换杆可将火车导向支线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The switch track is where the spur runs off the main line{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.51,0:47:30.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,直往下走三里就可到达克雷顿...修那许峡谷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}three miles out to Clayton... Shonash Ravine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.09,0:47:32.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,火车在星期一早上八点离站{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The train leaves the station at 8:00 Monday morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.97,0:47:35.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们将在此拦下它 将机关车和煤水车分开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll stop it here, uncouple the cars from the tender,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.60,0:47:37.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,板下转换杆 然后挟持...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}throw the switch track, and then we'll hijack...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.89,0:47:41.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,借用这机关车 用它来推动时光旅行车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Borrow the locomotive and use it to push the time machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.94,0:47:43.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,根据我的计算{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}According to my calculations,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.23,0:47:44.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们将在抵达峡谷的边缘之前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we'll reach 88 miles per hour{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.69,0:47:46.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,达到每小时88英里的速度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just before we hit the edge of the ravine,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.78,0:47:50.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这时候我们就将在一瞬间传送回1985年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at which point we'll be instantaneously transported back to 1985{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.53,0:47:52.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后安全地滑过已完成的桥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and coast safely across the completed bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.03,0:47:55.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么意思? 不归点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does this mean? "Point of no return."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.87,0:47:57.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我们的紧急停止点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's our fail-safe point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.91,0:47:59.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在到达那里之前 我们都还有足够的时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up until there, we have still have enough time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.37,0:48:01.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,停住火车 以免栽进那峡谷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to stop the locomotive before it plunges into the ravine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.04,0:48:03.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但只要我们一通过这风车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But once we pass this windmill,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.29,0:48:04.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是不成功便成仁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's the future or bust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.46,0:48:11.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来 马丁 把它接在正极上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you go, Marty. Connect that to the positive terminal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.13,0:48:13.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 马丁 全都准备好了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Marty, you all set?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.26,0:48:14.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,都好了 开始!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Yeah. Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.97,0:48:17.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,火车由车站开出!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Train pulling out of the station!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.72,0:48:19.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,慢慢接近那转换点!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming up to the switch track!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.98,0:48:22.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在转换点停下来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop at the switch track!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.65,0:48:24.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,转换铁轨!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Throw the switch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.98,0:48:27.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,开始推动德罗林车前进!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull up to the DeLorean!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.48,0:48:31.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,将德罗林推到每小时88英里!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pushing the DeLorean up to 88 miles per hour!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.04,0:48:40.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再简单不过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It couldn't be simpler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.76,0:48:42.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哈啰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.50,0:48:48.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾米?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emmett?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.59,0:48:50.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是克蕾拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Clara.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.26,0:48:52.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快! 把德罗林车盖起来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quick, cover the DeLorean!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.64,0:49:00.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哈啰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.73,0:49:01.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哈啰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.02,0:49:04.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这可真是个惊喜啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is quite a surprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.69,0:49:07.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,希望我没打扰到你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I hope I'm not disturbing anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.90,0:49:11.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有 我们只是在做铁路模型{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, no, we were just doing a little model railroading.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.57,0:49:17.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾米 当我的行李从马车上掉下来时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emmett, when my bags were thrown from the wagon,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.70,0:49:19.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的望远镜被碰坏了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my telescope was damaged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.66,0:49:23.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,既然你说你对科学很有兴趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And since you mentioned an interest in science,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.29,0:49:26.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想你应该可以帮我把它修好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you might be able to repair it for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.71,0:49:28.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然了 我会付你酬劳的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would pay you, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.75,0:49:33.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是绝对不会向你收钱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, no, no. I wouldn't think of charging you for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.13,0:49:35.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我先看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, let's have a look at it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.38,0:49:37.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想其中的一个镜片可能偏掉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think a lens may be out of alignment,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.72,0:49:41.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你若是将它往这边转{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because if you move it this way,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.35,0:49:44.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,影像就会变得模糊 看见了没?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the image turns fuzzy. See?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.48,0:49:49.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但你若是把它转向另一边...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if you turn it the other way then...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.52,0:49:52.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一切都变得...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything becomes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.24,0:49:56.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...非常清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.74,0:50:04.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以马上修理 今天晚上就可以还给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could repair it right away and have it for you tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.58,0:50:07.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,今天晚上是这个镇的嘉年华会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, tonight is the town festival.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.42,0:50:10.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不敢奢望你在这么重要的节日{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't dream of having you work on my telescope{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.09,0:50:11.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还会有时间修我的望远镜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}during such an important occasion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.92,0:50:15.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们打算参与这盛会 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are planning on attending, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.34,0:50:18.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上 小姐 我不认为...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, actually, ma'am, I don't think...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.09,0:50:20.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 当然了 嘉年华会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, of course, the festival.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.76,0:50:22.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,既然这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, in that case,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.77,0:50:26.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们今晚就在庆典中碰头了 艾米{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see you this evening at the festival, Emmett.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.39,0:50:28.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 伊斯特伍德先生 - 小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr. Eastwood. - Ma'am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.44,0:50:33.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你帮我修我的望远镜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for taking care of my telescope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.94,0:50:35.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,千万别客气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're quite welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.78,0:50:43.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这望远镜真不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a nice telescope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.29,0:50:45.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,各位先生女士们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.04,0:50:50.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,身为山谷市的市长 我很荣幸能在此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as mayor of Hill Valley, it gives me great pleasure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.50,0:50:53.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把这座钟献给希尔郡的乡亲们!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to dedicate this clock to the people of Hill County!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.80,0:50:58.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,愿它能永远地保存下去!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May it stand for all time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.63,0:50:59.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,时候到了就告诉我 各位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me when, gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.14,0:51:04.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,三 二 一!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three! Two! One!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.81,0:51:07.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,启用!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.61,0:51:15.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,开始各种庆祝活动吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let the festivities begin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.70,0:51:23.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗? 马丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Marty, in a way, it's fitting{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.91,0:51:26.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你和我有资格在此见证这一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you and I are here to witness this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.29,0:51:28.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可惜我没把照相机带来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too bad I didn't bring my camera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.67,0:51:36.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好? 两位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready, gentlemen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.17,0:51:41.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,问题是我们将永远无法把这照片拿给别人看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only problem is we'll never be able to show it to anybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.68,0:51:42.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,微笑 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smile, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.26,0:51:46.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哈!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yee-ha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.62,0:52:09.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好棒的音乐!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What great music!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.04,0:52:12.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 而且还有节奏 可以跳舞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it's got a beat, and you can dance to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.83,0:52:13.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,男士们 快上前来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Step right up gentlemen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.92,0:52:15.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,试试胆识 在此展示的是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and test your mettle with the latest products{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.92,0:52:19.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,位于康乃迪克州哈特佛的萨穆尔·科尔特上校火器制造厂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from Colonel Samuel Colt's Patent Firearms Manufacturing Company{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.05,0:52:21.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所推出的最新产品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of Hartford, Connecticut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.76,0:52:24.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 就拿这一型来做例子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, take this model, for example.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.76,0:52:28.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是经过改良精制的 科尔特转轮手枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The new, improved and refined Colt Peacemaker{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.52,0:52:33.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你今晚只要花12块的最低价就能够拥有它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}selling to you tonight for the low, low price of $12.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.87,0:52:51.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 晚安 - 晚安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good evening. - Evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.08,0:52:55.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你看来好漂亮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look very nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.58,0:52:57.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.93,0:53:07.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是否想...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.43,0:53:10.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是否愿意...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you care to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.72,0:53:11.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乐意之至{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd love to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.29,0:53:32.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,年轻人 要不要上来试试?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Young man, how about you? You want to give it a try?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.33,0:53:35.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 谢谢你 博士 这...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. No, thanks. Hey, Doc, this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.42,0:53:44.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老弟!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.47,0:53:46.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老弟!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sonny boy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.55,0:53:48.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士会跳舞?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Doc can dance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.64,0:53:54.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老弟 老弟 老弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son. Son. Son!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.60,0:53:59.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚说过连吃奶的娃儿都会用这武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I just told you that even a baby could handle this weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.11,0:54:02.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你该不会不敢尝试连奶娃儿都能做的事吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surely you're not afraid to try something that a baby could do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.28,0:54:03.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我什么也不怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I'm not afraid of nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.61,0:54:06.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那就来吧 像个男子汉般地站上去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, then. Let's just step up here like a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.66,0:54:11.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 你只需要把那撞针扳到后面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, then what you do is you just ease that hammer back there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.16,0:54:12.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后扣下板机就行了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and squeeze off a round.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.00,0:54:14.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不对!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.66,0:54:17.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对着前面轻轻地扳下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right on out there and be real smooth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.50,0:54:19.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是正确的方式{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the way you do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.05,0:54:24.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 我可以再试一次吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, can I try that again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.80,0:54:26.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然可以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, go ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.35,0:54:40.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, just tell me one thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.23,0:54:42.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你这一手好枪法是在哪学的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did you learn to shoot like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.86,0:54:44.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,统一便利商店{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}7-Eleven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.11,0:54:50.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,贝夫 你确定那个铁匠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buford, you sure that blacksmith{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.49,0:54:52.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,会参加这庆典吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is gonna be at this here shindig?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.37,0:54:55.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他一定会来 今晚所有的人都会来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure he's here. Everybody's here tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.79,0:54:59.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,各位如果想参加庆典活动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gentlemen will have to check your firearms{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.71,0:55:01.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就得将武器寄放在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you want to join in on the festivities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.30,0:55:04.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁能逼我们缴枪? 你?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's gonna make us, tenderfoot? You?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.88,0:55:06.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.43,0:55:12.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,史屈克兰警长 我不晓得你已回到这镇上了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marshal Strickland. I didn't know you was back in town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.26,0:55:13.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不识字无法读那告示{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you can't read the sign, Tannen,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.97,0:55:16.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想你应该认识这东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I presume you can read this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.64,0:55:17.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你这算什么男子汉?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty tough hombre when you're pointing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.06,0:55:19.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拿着猎枪对着别人的背后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a scatter gun at a man's back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.48,0:55:22.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,和你一样 添南 我会尽一切可能争取到优势{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like you, Tannen, I take every advantage I can get.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.69,0:55:25.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底要不要把枪寄放在这里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you gonna check your iron?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.03,0:55:28.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是跟你的副警长开开玩笑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was just joking with your deputy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.57,0:55:30.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我当然要寄放我的枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, I'm gonna check my iron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.36,0:55:31.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都打算这么做对吧? 弟兄们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all were. Weren't we, boys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.82,0:55:33.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.79,0:55:36.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,添南{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tannen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.41,0:55:39.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有你的刀子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your knife, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.13,0:55:49.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,笑一下吧 警长 这毕竟是个欢乐的场合啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smile, Marshal. After all, this is a party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.38,0:55:51.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,唯一能让我露出笑容的场合{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only party I'll be smiling at{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.93,0:55:54.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是当你收到绞刑的那一天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is the one that sees you at the end of a rope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.52,0:55:58.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好好玩吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have fun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.65,0:56:03.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你就是要这样对付他们 儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, that's how you handle them, Son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.06,0:56:05.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,永不让步{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never give them an inch{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.19,0:56:07.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在任何时候都得维持纪律{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and maintain discipline at all times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.61,0:56:10.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,记住这个字 纪律{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember that word, discipline.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.61,0:56:12.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会的 爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will, Pa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.04,0:56:19.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,多谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you very much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.16,0:56:23.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是你啊 伊斯特伍德先生 真高兴看见你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, Mr. Eastwood, nice to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.63,0:56:28.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看来你已经换上较体面的衣服了 再加上一顶好帽了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see you got yourself some respectable clothes, lad, and a fine hat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.13,0:56:29.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 有些人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, a couple people{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.26,0:56:31.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不喜欢我戴着另一顶的样子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}didn't like the way the other one looked on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.55,0:56:33.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这顶确实很适合你 伊斯特伍德先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure, and that one suits you, Mr. Eastwood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.30,0:56:35.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 非常体面 - 谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's very becoming. - Oh, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.35,0:56:39.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是飞盘呢! 正点(好远){\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, "Frisbie." Far out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.02,0:56:43.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么意思?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was the meaning of that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.48,0:56:45.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,明明就摆在他的面前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was right in front of him. Aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.83,0:57:01.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那是我的! - 不再是了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, that's mine! - Not anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.50,0:57:02.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拿给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.87,0:57:04.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他在那里 贝夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he is, Buford.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.67,0:57:07.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 哪里? - 那边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where? - There.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.25,0:57:09.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,正在跟那个妞儿跳舞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dancing with that piece of calico.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.84,0:57:12.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你打算怎么做? 老大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}THUG: What are you gonna do, boss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.93,0:57:16.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想 如果我把枪管{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I figure if I bury this muzzle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.51,0:57:19.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,紧紧地抵住他的背 没人会听见枪声{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}deep enough in his back, nobody will hear the shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.31,0:57:21.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小心点 贝夫 它只有一颗子弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful, Buford. You ain't got but one bullet with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.77,0:57:23.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只要一颗就足够了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I only need one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.32,0:57:37.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉过你背后要长眼睛 铁匠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you to watch your back, smithy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.28,0:57:39.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,添南 你来早了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tannen, you're early.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.58,0:57:41.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是一把掌心雷 铁匠 虽小却够威力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a Derringer, smithy. Small but effective.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.04,0:57:44.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,上回被我用这把枪打中的家伙 整整两天后才死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The last time I used it, fellow took two whole days to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.83,0:57:45.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,体内大量出血{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bled to death inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.92,0:57:47.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,死得非常痛苦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was real, real painful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.71,0:57:51.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这表示你会在星期一的晚饭时间魂归西天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That means you'll be dead by about supper time Monday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.42,0:57:54.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 我不知道你以为你是谁 但我们正在跳舞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me. I don't know who you think you are, but we're dancing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.88,0:57:57.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看看我们遇上了谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, look at what we have here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.09,0:57:58.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不为我介绍一下这女士?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ain't you gonna introduce me to the lady?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.72,0:57:59.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想跳支舞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like a dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.85,0:58:01.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你休想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't give you the pleasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.18,0:58:03.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还是开枪好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll just have to go ahead and shoot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.68,0:58:04.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.77,0:58:05.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不! 艾米 我跟他跳好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. Emmett, I'll dance with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.02,0:58:07.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,弟兄们 好好陪这位铁匠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boys, keep the blacksmith company{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.90,0:58:09.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我跟这位姑娘认识一下!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while I get acquainted with the filly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.03,0:58:19.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当我的舞伴手里有把枪时 我无法跳得很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't dance very well when my partner has a gun in his hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.53,0:58:22.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你会适应的 你会适应的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll learn. You'll learn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.12,0:58:25.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,铁匠 我看我就从她身上讨回那八十块吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, smithy, maybe I'll just take my $80 worth out of her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.46,0:58:26.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,添南 放开她!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tannen, leave her alone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.42,0:58:33.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 我敢说你一定能做些值八十块的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I bet there's something you can do that's worth $80.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.17,0:58:37.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想你是低估我了 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe you've underestimated me, mister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.76,0:58:39.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.69,0:58:49.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 放开我! 住手! 住手 - 你该死! 添南!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stop it! - Damn you, Tannen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.77,0:58:52.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 该死的是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I damn you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.69,0:58:56.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要送你下地狱去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I damn you to hell!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.99,0:59:04.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.24,0:59:05.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,少找他麻烦! 混蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, lighten up, jerk!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.96,0:59:11.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好大的口气! 小鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mighty strong words, runt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.00,0:59:13.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你敢用盘子以外的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You man enough to back them up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.55,0:59:16.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,替他们出头吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with more than just a pie plate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.43,0:59:21.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 别烦我的朋友们就行了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, just leave my friends alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.64,0:59:24.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么? 小子 你没胆吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong, dude? You yellow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.65,0:59:34.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道 是个胆小鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I thought. A yellow belly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.66,0:59:43.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是胆小鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody calls me yellow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.16,0:59:47.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在就来做个了断吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then let's finish it right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.54,0:59:50.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在不行 贝夫 警长把我们的枪收走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not now, Buford. Marshal's got our guns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.37,0:59:52.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 我们就明天做个了断!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like I said, we'll finish this tomorrow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.58,0:59:55.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,明天我们要去抢松树镇的驿马车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomorrow we're robbing the Pine City stage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.96,0:59:58.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,星期一呢? 我们星期一有节目吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about Monday? We doing anything Monday?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.51,1:00:00.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有 星期一可以 你可以星期一杀他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Monday would be fine. You can kill him on Monday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.55,1:00:02.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我星期一会回这里来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be back this way on Monday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.89,1:00:04.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们到时再算这笔帐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll settle this then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.55,1:00:07.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就在那边的大街上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right there out in the street{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.35,1:00:08.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,皇宫酒馆的前面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in front of the Palace Saloon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.31,1:00:12.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 什么时候?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, right. When?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.48,1:00:14.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 日正当中? - 中午?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- High noon? - Noon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.86,1:00:18.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一向都在吃早餐前杀人的 七点钟!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do my killing before breakfast. 7:00!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.20,1:00:25.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,八点好了 我一向都吃过早餐才杀人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}8:00. I do my killing after breakfast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.99,1:00:27.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.08,1:00:33.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 你们两个住手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, now. Break it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.21,1:00:34.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's all this about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.33,1:00:37.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你又在这里惹麻烦了? 添南{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You causing trouble here, Tannen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.13,1:00:38.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没惹麻烦 警长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No trouble, Marshal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.92,1:00:42.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只是我跟伊斯特伍德之间的私事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a little personal matter between me and Eastwood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.93,1:00:44.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,和法律无关{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This don't concern the law.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.30,1:00:47.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚所有的事都和法律有关 好了 大家散开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tonight, everything concerns the law. Now break it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.26,1:00:50.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,若有任何人闹事 都得在郡立监狱里待上十五天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any brawling, it's 15 days in the county jail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.77,1:00:52.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 各位 这是个派对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, folks. Come on, this is a party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.06,1:00:55.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 大伙儿好好乐一下!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Let's have some fun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.28,1:01:02.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,星期一早上8点 小鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}8:00 Monday, runt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.57,1:01:03.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不出现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you ain't here,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.07,1:01:07.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是走遍天涯海角也要找到你 把你当鸭子宰了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll hunt you and shoot you down like a duck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.04,1:01:11.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是狗 贝夫 像杀狗般地把他宰了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's "dog," Buford. Shoot him down like a dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.29,1:01:15.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们走! 弟兄们 让这些娘娘腔的享受他们的派对!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go, boys! Let these sissies have their party!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.17,1:01:18.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 你在干么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, what are you doing,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.25,1:01:19.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你答应跟添南决斗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}saying you're gonna meet Tannen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.71,1:01:21.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 你放心好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Doc, Doc, don't worry about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.80,1:01:22.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,星期一早上8点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monday morning 8:00 a.m.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.92,1:01:24.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们早就走了 不是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna be gone, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.34,1:01:27.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 但火车若是误点呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Theoretically, yes, but what if the train's late?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.39,1:01:28.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,误点? 我们待会再谈这件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Late? We'll discuss this later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.89,1:01:30.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 现在就谈 误点? 什么意思?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, we'll discuss it now. Late? What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.14,1:01:31.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你英勇的行为 伊斯特伍德先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for your gallantry, Mr. Eastwood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.43,1:01:32.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别客气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, ma'am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.77,1:01:35.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你没及时插手 艾米可能会挨枪的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had you not interceded, Emmett might have been shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.23,1:01:37.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁...克林特 我要送克蕾拉回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty... Clint, I'm gonna take Clara home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.07,1:01:39.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 晚安 博士 晚安 克蕾拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. Good night, Doc. Good night, Clara.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.48,1:01:41.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你可教训了他 伊斯特伍德先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure set him straight, Mr. Eastwood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.28,1:01:42.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我真高兴终于有人有勇气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm glad somebody finally got the gumption{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.44,1:01:44.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,站出来对抗那个狗杂种{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to stand up to that son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.20,1:01:45.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你真是了不起 伊斯特伍德先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're all right in my book, Mr. Eastwood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.74,1:01:46.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我请你喝一杯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to buy you a drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.03,1:01:48.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 我不想喝酒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, listen, I don't want a drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.12,1:01:49.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不必买给我任何东西 年轻人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to buy me anything. Young man. Young man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.91,1:01:51.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这算不了什么 - 我要你收下这把全新的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It was no big deal. - I'd like for you to have this brand-new{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.95,1:01:55.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,科尔特枪 免费送给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colt Peacemaker and gun belt free of charge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.29,1:01:57.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,免费?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Free?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.46,1:01:58.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要让每个人知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want everybody to know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.96,1:02:02.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那把杀死贝夫·添南的枪 是一把科尔特的枪!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the gun that shot Buford Tannen was a Colt Peacemaker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.84,1:02:05.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题 多谢你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, no problem. Thanks a lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.72,1:02:07.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然 你应该也知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course you understand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.22,1:02:09.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你输了 我就要将它收回{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that if you lose, I'm taking it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.81,1:02:14.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,多谢你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.60,1:02:19.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟他正面冲突 伊斯特伍德先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had him, Mr. Eastwood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.31,1:02:20.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你大可走开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could have just walked away,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.48,1:02:22.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有人会怪你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and nobody would have thought the less of you for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.82,1:02:27.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大不了被人在背后说两句 或是被贝夫嘲笑几次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All it would have been was words, hot air from a buffoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.11,1:02:28.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但你却让他邀你决斗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Instead, you let him rile you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.87,1:02:32.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让他引诱你用他的规则来解决纷争{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rile you into playing his game, his way, by his rules.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.99,1:02:35.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢穆斯 别紧张 我知道自己在做什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seamus, relax. I know what I'm doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.46,1:02:36.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他让我想起可怜的马丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He reminds me of poor Martin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.54,1:02:37.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.62,1:02:38.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谁? - 我弟弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who? - Me brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.88,1:02:39.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,慢着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. Wait a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.00,1:02:42.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的弟弟叫马丁·麦佛莱?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a brother named Martin McFly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.13,1:02:44.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是我的亡弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had a brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.63,1:02:47.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁在世时老爱与人决斗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Martin used to let men provoke him into fighting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.38,1:02:50.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他总认为如果他拒绝的话 人家会认为他没胆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was concerned that people would think him a coward if he refused.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.35,1:02:52.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,结果他才会在维吉尼亚城{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how he got a Bowie knife shoved through his belly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.81,1:02:55.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,被人在肚子上刺了一刀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a saloon in Virginia City.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.77,1:02:57.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从不考虑未来 可怜的马丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never considered the future, poor Martin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.69,1:02:59.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,愿他的灵魂安息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God rest his soul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.11,1:03:04.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你能多为未来着想 伊斯特伍德先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure, and I hope you're considering the future, Mr. Eastwood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.20,1:03:10.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我无时无刻不在想未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think about it all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.58,1:03:13.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有西北方中央的那巨蟹座{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that crater in the middle north west,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.37,1:03:15.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那个孤单的 像一团星爆似的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the one that's out there all by itself like a starburst...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.50,1:03:18.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...那颗叫做哥白尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that one's called Copernicus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.75,1:03:22.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你听我这口吻 我觉得自己像在教书似的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me. I feel like I'm teaching school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.38,1:03:25.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 拜托 请继续教下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, continue the lesson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.96,1:03:28.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不晓得天文学是如此的有趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never found lunar geography so fascinating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.05,1:03:31.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你真是博学多闻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're quite knowledgeable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.22,1:03:32.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当我十一岁时 我得了白喉病{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I was 11, I had diphtheria.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.05,1:03:35.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,被隔离了三个月{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was quarantined for three months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.14,1:03:37.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我父亲买了这个望远镜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So my father brought this telescope,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.31,1:03:38.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把它放在我的床边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he put it next to my bed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.77,1:03:41.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我能看到窗外的风景{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I could see everything out the window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.48,1:03:45.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾米 你想我们将来是否能像搭火车横越这个国家般地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emmett, do you think we'll ever be able to travel to the moon{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.90,1:03:48.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到月球上去旅行?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the way we travel across the country on trains?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.07,1:03:52.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,绝对可能 只不过还得再等上84年的时间 也不是搭火车去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Definitely. Although not for 84 years and not on trains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.57,1:03:56.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们将会有太空船 利用火箭的推力升空{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll have space vehicles, capsules sent aloft with rockets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.50,1:03:58.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,某种能产生猛烈爆炸的装置{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Devices that create giant explosions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.41,1:04:00.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那爆炸的威力之强大...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Explosions so powerful that they just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.92,1:04:03.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,足以脱离地心引力的控制{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That they break the pull of the Earth's gravity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.08,1:04:06.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,将那飞行器送到外太空去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and send the projectile through outer space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.76,1:04:10.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾米 我也读过那本书啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emmett, I read that book, too!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.22,1:04:12.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是在引述儒勒·凡尔纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're quoting Jules Verne{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.30,1:04:13.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在《月球之旅》里所描述的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From the Earth to the Moon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.85,1:04:16.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你也读儒勒·凡尔纳的书?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've read Jules Verne?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.89,1:04:18.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我最喜欢儒勒·凡尔纳的书{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I adore Jules Verne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.89,1:04:20.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So do I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.60,1:04:23.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那部《海底两万里》是我最喜欢的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twenty Thousand Leagues Under the Sea. My absolute favorite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.56,1:04:25.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当我小时候第一次读这本书时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The first time I read that when I was a little boy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.57,1:04:28.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就好想认识尼莫船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}why, I wanted to meet Captain Nemo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.24,1:04:29.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别开玩笑了 艾米{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't tease, Emmett.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.49,1:04:31.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不可能在小时候读过那本书的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You couldn't have read that when you were a boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.45,1:04:33.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它是十年前才出版的啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was only first published 10 years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.12,1:04:37.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 我是说 它让我觉得自己像个小男孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes. Well, I meant it made me feel like a boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.29,1:04:44.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我这辈子还不曾遇见过一个喜欢儒勒·凡尔纳的书的女性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never met a woman who liked Jules Verne before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.96,1:04:50.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我这辈子也不曾遇见过一个像你这样的男人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never ever met a man like you before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.77,1:05:49.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.78,1:05:55.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你知道自己在做什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hope you know what you're doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.38,1:06:10.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在跟我说话?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You talking to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.88,1:06:15.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在跟我说话? 添南{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You talking to me, Tannen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.05,1:06:21.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这里只有我一个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm the only one here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.72,1:06:25.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧! 不怕死就来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead, make my day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.90,1:06:33.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,早 伊斯特伍德先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say good morning, Mr. Eastwood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.49,1:06:34.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,早{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.86,1:06:36.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抽根雪茄吧 伊斯特伍德先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have a cigar, Mr. Eastwood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.57,1:06:39.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,今天需要我效劳吗? 伊斯特伍德先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything I can do for you today, Mr. Eastwood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.16,1:06:40.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不用了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, that's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.78,1:06:42.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,祝你明天好运 伊斯特伍德先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck tomorrow, Mr. Eastwood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.41,1:06:43.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会为你祈祷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll be praying for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.08,1:06:45.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.41,1:06:48.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,早 伊斯特伍德先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning, Mr. Eastwood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.58,1:06:50.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,明天打算穿新衣服上场吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Interest you in a new suit for tomorrow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.63,1:06:54.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不用了 谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fine. Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.77,1:07:07.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 你在干什么啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, what are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.94,1:07:09.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.40,1:07:11.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是出来呼吸一下清晨的空气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was just out enjoying the morning air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.07,1:07:14.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,此地的早晨美极了 你说是不是?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's really lovely here in the morning. Don't you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.48,1:07:15.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对 美极了 博土{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it's lovely, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.61,1:07:16.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 我们把德罗林车放上铁轨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So listen, we've got to load the DeLorean up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.95,1:07:18.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,准备上路吧 好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and get ready to roll, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.61,1:07:21.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看 是墓碑呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, look at that, the tombstone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.83,1:07:25.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 再让我看看那张照片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, let me see that photograph again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.50,1:07:30.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的名字 已经消失了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name, it's vanished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.38,1:07:32.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这真是太好了 博士 你还不明白吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, that's great, Doc. Don't you get it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.84,1:07:33.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们明天就要回未来去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going back to the future tomorrow,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.00,1:07:35.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这一切都将改变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so everything's being erased.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.42,1:07:37.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但只有我的名字消失{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But only my name is erased.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.30,1:07:39.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这块墓碑和上面的日期仍然存在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The tombstone itself and the date still remain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.13,1:07:41.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是说不通的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That doesn't make sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.14,1:07:43.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道这张照片代表着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know that this photograph represents what will happen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.81,1:07:45.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,今天的事件若是延续到明天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if the events of today continue{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.31,1:07:47.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,则将会发生的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to run their course into tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.23,1:07:48.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 那又怎样?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. So?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.31,1:07:49.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 伊斯特伍德先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, Mr. Eastwood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.64,1:07:51.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要量你的身材{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just need to take your measurements.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.15,1:07:53.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 兄弟 我不想买西装{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, look, pal, I don't want to buy a suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.36,1:07:56.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我是在量你棺材的尺寸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, this is for your coffin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.57,1:07:57.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的棺材?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My coffin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.69,1:08:00.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的赔率是2比1{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the odds are running two to one against you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.24,1:08:02.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,趁早准备也好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Might as well be prepared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.66,1:08:06.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以 刻在那块墓碑上的可能不是我的名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So it may not be my name that's supposed to end up on this tombstone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.20,1:08:07.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可能是你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It may be yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.21,1:08:10.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great Scott.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.33,1:08:11.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 这恐怕难以承受{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. This is heavy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.37,1:08:13.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 你带着那把枪做什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, why are you wearing that gun?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.42,1:08:15.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你该不会真的打算明天和添南决斗吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not considering going up against Tannen tomorrow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.59,1:08:18.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 明天一大早我将和你回到未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, tomorrow morning I'm going back to the future with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.51,1:08:20.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但贝夫·添南若是来找麻烦的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if Buford Tannen comes looking for trouble,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.34,1:08:21.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我将会要他好看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna be ready for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.01,1:08:24.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你也听见那混蛋昨晚用什么字眼骂我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard what that son of a bitch called me last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.47,1:08:25.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 你不能每回一有人骂你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, you can't go losing your judgment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.81,1:08:27.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你就失去理智{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}every time someone calls you a name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.35,1:08:28.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你将来就是因为这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's exactly what causes you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.43,1:08:31.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而才出事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to get into that accident in the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.02,1:08:36.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我将来会发生什么事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? What about my future?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.86,1:08:39.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能告诉你 这可能会让事情变得更糟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't tell you. It might make things worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.07,1:08:43.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,慢着 博士 我在未来出了什么事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. Doc, what is wrong with my future?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.78,1:08:46.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 我们都得做一些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, we all have to make decisions{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.08,1:08:49.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,会改变我们一生的决定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that affect the course of our lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.54,1:08:52.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你得做你应该做的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got to do what you've got to do,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.54,1:08:54.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也得做我应该做的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I've got to do what I've got to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.89,1:09:07.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 马丁 - 什么事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Marty. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.01,1:09:09.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经做了决定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've made a decision. Uh-huh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.89,1:09:10.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我明天不跟你回去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not going with you tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.10,1:09:13.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要留在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm staying here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.19,1:09:20.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在胡说什么啊? 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about, Doc?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.11,1:09:21.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没必要否认这事实{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no point in denying it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.07,1:09:23.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱上克蕾拉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm in love with Clara.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.24,1:09:24.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.70,1:09:28.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 我们不属于这里啊 我们两个都不属于这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, we don't belong here. Neither one of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.87,1:09:31.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗? 明天被杀的人仍有可能是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, it could still be you that gets shot tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.83,1:09:34.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这块墓碑仍有可能是你的未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This tombstone could still be in your future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.46,1:09:37.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 未来不是一成不变的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, the future isn't written.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.88,1:09:40.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它可以被改变 这点你也知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can be changed. You know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.71,1:09:45.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,任何人都可以把他们的未来改变成他们所喜欢的样子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyone can make their future whatever they want it to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.47,1:09:47.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能让这张小小的照片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't let this one little photograph{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.26,1:09:49.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,决定我的一辈子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}determine my entire destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.93,1:09:51.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我得依照{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to live my life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.27,1:09:55.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我内心认为正确的方式 来过我的生活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}according to what I believe is right in my heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.44,1:10:00.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 你是个科学家啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, you're a scientist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.28,1:10:06.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你倒是说说看 你脑袋所认为该做的事是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you tell me. What's the right thing to do up here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.63,1:10:22.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对 马丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right, Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.90,1:10:46.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这玩意真管用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow, that worked great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.15,1:10:49.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我最起码得跟她说声再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've at least got to tell her goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.99,1:10:52.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样 博士 想想看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Doc. Think about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.04,1:10:54.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你该怎么告诉她?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you gonna say to her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.50,1:10:55.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"我得回到未来去? "{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I've got to go back to the future?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.00,1:10:58.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说 她是不会了解的 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, she's not gonna understand that, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.33,1:10:59.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,连和你在一起的我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell, I'm in it with you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.46,1:11:02.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,都不怎么了解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I don't even understand it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.59,1:11:07.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 听我说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.84,1:11:10.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我们可以...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.51,1:11:13.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我们可以带克蕾拉一起走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, maybe we can just take Clara with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.97,1:11:16.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,回到未来去?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the future?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.77,1:11:23.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你刚刚提醒过我 马丁 我是个科学家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you reminded me, Marty, I'm a scientist,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.52,1:11:26.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我得以科学的角度来看这件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I must be scientific about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.28,1:11:28.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我曾经警告过你不可为了私益{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cautioned you about disrupting the continuum{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.20,1:11:29.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而破坏了时空的连续性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for your own personal benefit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.61,1:11:31.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我自己也不能这么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Therefore, I must do no less.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.95,1:11:33.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们将照计划进行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We shall proceed as planned,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.16,1:11:35.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而在我们一回到1985年后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and as soon as we return to 1985,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.20,1:11:38.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就把这不祥的机器毁掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we'll destroy this infernal machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.79,1:11:42.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,时光旅行太让人痛苦了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Traveling through time has become much too painful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.70,1:12:14.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是我 艾米 克蕾拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Emmett, Clara.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.58,1:12:21.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾米 你不进来吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emmett, won't you come in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.42,1:12:24.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我想还是不要...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I better not. I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.80,1:12:28.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.59,1:12:31.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是来道别的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've come to say goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.93,1:12:35.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,道别? 你要上哪去?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye? Well, where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.10,1:12:38.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.10,1:12:40.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我恐怕再也见不到你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And well, I'm afraid I'll never see you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.27,1:12:43.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾米!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emmett!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.69,1:12:48.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克蕾拉 我要你知道我非常爱你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clara, I want you to know that I care about you deeply.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.94,1:12:51.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我明白我是不属于这里的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I've realized that I don't belong here,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.70,1:12:55.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我得回到我所来的地方去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I have to go back where I came from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.45,1:12:57.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么地方?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And where might that be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.08,1:12:59.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能告诉你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.08,1:13:05.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不管你要去哪 带我一起走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, wherever you're going, take me with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.21,1:13:09.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能这么做 克蕾拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't, Clara.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.55,1:13:10.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只希望一切能不演变至此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish it didn't have to be this way,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.97,1:13:12.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但请你相信我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but just believe me when I tell you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.59,1:13:17.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我这辈子永远不会忘记你 而且 我永远爱着你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I'll never forget you and that I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.18,1:13:21.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不明白你想告诉我什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand what you're trying to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.52,1:13:25.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克蕾拉 我不认为你能够了解这件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clara, I don't think there's any way that you can understand it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.15,1:13:28.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,求求你 艾米 我一定得知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, Emmett. Please, I have to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.61,1:13:30.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你真的爱我的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you sincerely do love me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.32,1:13:31.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那就把实情告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then tell me the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.74,1:13:35.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.45,1:13:37.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是由未来回来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm from the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.70,1:13:42.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我乘坐一架我所发明的时光机器回到这个时代{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came here in a time machine that I invented,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.79,1:13:46.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,明天 我就得回到1985年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and tomorrow I have to go back to the year 1985.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.09,1:13:54.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 艾米{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Emmett.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.93,1:13:57.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我很能够了解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.18,1:14:02.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我明白 因为你知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand that because you know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.60,1:14:04.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜爱儒勒·凡尔纳所写的书{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm partial to the writings of Jules Verne,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.98,1:14:06.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你编造出这种谎言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you concocted those mendacities{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.48,1:14:08.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想骗我上当{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in order to take advantage of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.48,1:14:11.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我这辈子领教过许多谎言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! I've heard some whoppers in my day,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.03,1:14:13.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但你要我相信你这些鬼话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the fact that you'd expect me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.24,1:14:14.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,简直是对我的一大侮辱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to entertain a notion like that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.61,1:14:17.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可耻之至!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is so insulting and degrading!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.16,1:14:20.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你只需要说 "我不爱你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All you had to say is, "I don't love you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.04,1:14:23.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想再见到你"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I don't want to see you anymore."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.20,1:14:25.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这对我起码还比较尊重!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That, at least, would have been respectful!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.42,1:14:27.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但事实并不是这样啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that's not the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.42,1:15:09.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,见到你真好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good to see you, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.59,1:15:14.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾米 要杯和往常一样的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emmett. What can I get you? The usual?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.21,1:15:15.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 切斯特 我今晚需要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Chester, I'm gonna need something{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.88,1:15:18.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,烈一点的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a lot stronger than that tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.09,1:15:19.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,沙士?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sarsaparilla.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.59,1:15:20.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给我威士忌 却斯特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whiskey, Chester.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.85,1:15:24.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威士忌? 艾米 你确定吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whiskey? Emmett, are you sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.35,1:15:26.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还记得你国庆日那天发生的事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what happened to you on the Fourth of July.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.77,1:15:27.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给我威士忌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whiskey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.35,1:15:32.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 反正我又不是你爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I ain't your papa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.65,1:15:35.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是不希望看到你做傻事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just don't want to see you do the wrong thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.24,1:15:39.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,整瓶放在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can leave the bottle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.12,1:15:42.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是为了女人 对不对?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a woman, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.62,1:15:46.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道 我走遍了全国各地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew it. I have seen that look on a man's face{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.95,1:15:49.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在上千个男人脸上见过这表情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a thousand times all across the country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.92,1:15:52.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只能告诉你 朋友 你会忘了她的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I can tell you, friend, is you'll get over her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.34,1:15:55.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不可能 克蕾拉这样的女人 百万中才有一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh... Clara was one in a million.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.84,1:16:01.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,十亿中才有一个 是恒河里的一粒沙了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One in a billion. One in a googolplex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.18,1:16:04.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我梦中的女人 而我却永远的失去了她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The woman of my dreams, and I've lost her for all time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.10,1:16:09.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以向你保证 先生 你还会碰到别的女人的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can assure you, sir, there are other women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.64,1:16:12.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,根据我在全国各地推销这铁丝网所得到的经验{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, peddling this barbed wire all across the country{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.36,1:16:14.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我知道一件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has taught me one thing for certain,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.77,1:16:17.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那就是你永远无法知道未来将会怎样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is that you never know what the future might bring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.82,1:16:21.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,未来 我可以告诉你未来将会怎样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The future. Oh, I can tell you about the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.17,1:16:34.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老天 我睡得像个死人似的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, man, did I sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.17,1:16:39.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,几点了? 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What time is it, Doc?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.01,1:16:44.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.52,1:16:56.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,醒醒!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.53,1:17:00.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,起来! 我们该上路了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up! Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.70,1:17:03.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还得赶去杀那臭小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got me a runt to kill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.78,1:17:06.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,时间还早啊! 老大 你急什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's still early, boss. What's your hurry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.79,1:17:09.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我饿了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm hungry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.87,1:17:12.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且在未来 我们将不需要马{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in the future, we don't need horses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.63,1:17:18.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们将使用名叫汽车的动力车辆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have motorized carriages called automobiles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.21,1:17:22.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果每个人都有辆这种叫做汽什么的鸟玩意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If everybody's got one of these auto whatsits,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.68,1:17:25.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,人们还会走路或跑步吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}does anybody walk or run anymore?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.76,1:17:29.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然会跑步了 但是为了休闲 为了娱乐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course we run, but for recreation, for fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.77,1:17:33.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拿跑步当做娱乐? 这算哪门子的娱乐啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run for fun? What the hell kind of fun is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.70,1:17:45.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 博士!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc! Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.75,1:17:54.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他已经喝几杯了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much has he had?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.62,1:17:56.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一杯也没有 那还是第一杯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None. That's the first one,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.42,1:17:57.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他甚至连第一杯都还没下肚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he hasn't touched it yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.75,1:18:00.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他只喜欢捧着那杯酒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He just likes to hold it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.88,1:18:06.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士! 博士 你在干么啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc! Doc! What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.85,1:18:11.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我失去她了 马丁 此地对我已不值得留恋了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've lost her, Marty. There's nothing left for me here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.22,1:18:13.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 所以你便得跟我回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, that's why you gotta come back with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.23,1:18:14.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,回哪去?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.27,1:18:15.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,回到未来啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back to the future!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.77,1:18:21.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对! 我们上路吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right! Let's get going!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.78,1:18:22.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好极了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.94,1:18:26.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,各位 失陪了 我的小友和我还得赶搭一班火车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen, excuse me, but my friend and I have to catch a train.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.20,1:18:27.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我敬你 铁匠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's to you, blacksmith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.99,1:18:29.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,敬未来一杯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And to the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.37,1:18:30.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,阿门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.87,1:18:32.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 阿门 - 不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Amen. - Emmett, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.63,1:18:43.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 博士 博士!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc! Doc! Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.51,1:18:47.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 博士 醒醒 快醒醒 博士!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Doc. Wake up. Wake up, Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.59,1:18:49.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他喝几杯了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many did he have?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.64,1:18:50.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就那一杯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just the one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.85,1:18:52.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只有一杯? 别装醉了 博土{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just the one? Come on, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.06,1:18:55.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有的人的酒量就是这么差{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a fellow that can't hold his liquor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.39,1:18:57.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帮我弄些黑咖啡来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me some coffee. Black!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.14,1:18:58.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊 拿咖啡来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Joey, coffee!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.28,1:19:10.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小姐?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ma'am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.49,1:19:12.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,八点的火车最远到哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How far does the 8:00 train go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.49,1:19:14.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,终点站是旧金山{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}San Francisco is the end of the line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.50,1:19:18.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给我一张单程票{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take a one-way ticket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.00,1:19:22.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你要立刻把他弄醒 老弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to sober him up in a hurry, son,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.13,1:19:24.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你就得用些比咖啡更够劲的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're gonna have to use something a lot stronger than coffee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.17,1:19:26.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你建议用什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, what do you suggest?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.88,1:19:30.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊 我们来做些醒酒剂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Joey, let's make some wake-up juice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.34,1:19:32.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 博士 喝下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Doc, swallow. Here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.94,1:19:39.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,十分钟后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In about 10 minutes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.02,1:19:43.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他将有如星期天的牧师般地清醒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he's gonna be as sober as a priest on Sunday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.07,1:19:45.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,十分钟?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten minutes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.32,1:19:47.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们为什么总在最后关头出事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do we have to cut these things so damn close?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.86,1:19:50.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来 用这衣夹夹住他的鼻子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, stick this clothespin on his nose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.45,1:19:54.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当他把嘴巴张开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When he opens up his mouth,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.62,1:19:58.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就把这玩意儿灌进他的嘴里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}go ahead and pour it on down his gullet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.16,1:19:59.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对了 往后退一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, and stand back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.35,1:20:19.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他还没醒过来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's still out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.44,1:20:21.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚那只是反射作用罢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that? That was just a reflex action.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.73,1:20:23.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还得再等几分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna take a few more minutes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.23,1:20:25.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这东西才能让他的脑袋完全清醒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the stuff to really clear up his head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.15,1:20:26.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真是太好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.63,1:20:49.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 博士 快醒醒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Doc. Come on, wake up, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.84,1:20:52.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快醒醒 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake up, Doc! Come on. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.80,1:20:55.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢穆斯 我没料到你今天早上会来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seamus, wouldn't expect to see you here this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.47,1:20:59.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 但我心里有个声音叫我一定得来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye. Something inside me told me I should be here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.43,1:21:03.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就好像这关系着我的未来似的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as if my future had something to do with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.27,1:21:07.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他马上就会醒过来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll come around in a minute. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.82,1:21:09.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,醒醒 快醒醒 博土!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Doc. Let's go, Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.86,1:21:11.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,醒醒啊! 博士 醒醒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's wake up now, buddy. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.83,1:21:21.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在里面吗? 伊斯特伍德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you in there, Eastwood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.08,1:21:26.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,已经八点了! 我叫你给我出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's 8:00, and I'm calling you out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.09,1:21:32.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还不到八点钟啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not 8:00 yet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.18,1:21:35.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,以我的表为准!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is by my watch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.22,1:21:38.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们来了断这笔帐! 臭小子!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's settle this once and for all, runt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.81,1:21:42.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,难道你是没胆吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or ain't you got the gumption?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.36,1:21:44.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(克林特·伊斯特伍德长眠于此)
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.57,1:21:52.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.32,1:21:58.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我今天觉得手不大顺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not really feeling up to this today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.74,1:22:01.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我只好弃权{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I'm gonna have to forfeit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.04,1:22:04.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,弃权?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forfeit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.96,1:22:06.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么意思?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.09,1:22:10.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,意思是你不必决斗就赢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means that you win without a fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.17,1:22:11.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不必开枪? 他不能这么做啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without shooting? He can't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.05,1:22:14.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能这么做啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you can't do that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.26,1:22:15.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我的看法是如何吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what I think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.84,1:22:19.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为你是个没用的胆小鬼!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you ain't nothing but a gutless, yellow turd!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.26,1:22:21.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我给你数到十的时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm giving you to the count of 10{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.81,1:22:23.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到外面来证明我错了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to come out here and prove I'm wrong!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.85,1:22:26.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.23,1:22:28.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 快点 醒醒 兄弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, come on, sober up, buddy. Let's go. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.90,1:22:29.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,二!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.02,1:22:31.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还是快出去吧 老弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better get out there, son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.36,1:22:34.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我押了20块的金子赌你获胜 别让我失望了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got $20 gold bet on you, so don't let me down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.57,1:22:35.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,三!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.86,1:22:40.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我押了30块的金子赌你输 你更不能让我失望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got $30 gold bet against you, so don't let me down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.16,1:22:41.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,四!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.24,1:22:43.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还是面对现实吧 老弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better face up to it, son,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.29,1:22:45.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你若是不出去的话...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because if you don't go out there...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.79,1:22:47.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎样? 五!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Five!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.75,1:22:50.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我不出去呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if I don't go out there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.42,1:22:51.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你就是个懦夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a coward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.75,1:22:52.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,六!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.92,1:22:56.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你这辈子都将被贴上懦夫的标签!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you'll be branded a coward for the rest of your days!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.18,1:23:00.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不管你以后走到哪里 大家都会说克林特·伊斯特伍德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody everywhere will say Clint Eastwood{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.39,1:23:03.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是西部最可耻的弱夫!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is the biggest yellow belly in the West!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.23,1:23:09.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,七!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seven!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.31,1:23:11.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.57,1:23:16.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,八!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.58,1:23:26.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经有枪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I already got a gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.87,1:23:30.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,九!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.96,1:23:36.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,十!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.10,1:23:42.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你听见了没? 臭小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you hear me, runt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.89,1:23:47.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经数到了10了 你这个没胆没用的懦夫!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said that's 10, you gutless, yellow pie-slinger!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.77,1:23:53.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他根本是个王八蛋!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's an asshole!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.11,1:23:55.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我才不在乎添南说什么!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care what Tannen says!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.15,1:23:58.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不在乎别人说什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I don't care what anybody else says either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.24,1:24:00.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士! 博士 你没事吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc! Doc, you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.66,1:24:01.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想是吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.95,1:24:04.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的头痛死了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a headache!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.49,1:24:06.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 你这地方有后门吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, you got a back door to this place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.33,1:24:07.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有 就在后面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it's in the back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.45,1:24:08.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们走 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.58,1:24:12.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是要出来呢 还是要我进去找你?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you coming out here, or do I have to come in after you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.04,1:24:15.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们这里唯一缺的就是头痛药{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The thing I really miss here is Tylenol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.84,1:24:17.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.97,1:24:25.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还想跑? 铁匠!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reach, blacksmith!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.49,1:24:45.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 先生 我昨晚遇见那个可怜的家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir, that poor fellow last night{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.28,1:24:49.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是我这辈子见过最伤心的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had the worst case of broken heart I have ever seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.33,1:24:50.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,特别是当他提到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When he said he didn't know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.66,1:24:52.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在他伤透了那女孩的心之后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how he could live the rest of his life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.46,1:24:55.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他不晓得自己还能如何活下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}knowing how much hurt he'd caused that little girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.34,1:24:59.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很同情他 衷心地同情他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I really felt for him. I did. Right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.18,1:25:05.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给我听着! 姓伊斯特伍德的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen up, Eastwood!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.01,1:25:07.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老子今天非得宰一个人不可{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I aim to shoot somebody today,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.64,1:25:09.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但最好是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I prefer it'd be you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.52,1:25:12.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但你若是太没种的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if you're just too damn yellow,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.14,1:25:14.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那我只好宰你这个铁匠朋友了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess it'll just have to be your blacksmith friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.69,1:25:17.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别管我! 马丁 你快逃命!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget about me, Marty, and save yourself!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.15,1:25:24.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我给你一分钟的时间作决定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got one minute to decide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.36,1:25:26.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你听见了没? 小子 一分钟!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hear me, runt? One minute!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.91,1:25:32.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我从没见过男人会为了一个女人而如此伤心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never seen a man so broken up over a woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.00,1:25:35.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他说她叫什么名字? 卡拉? 莎拉?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did he say her name was? Cara? Sara?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.71,1:25:37.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是克蕾拉 - 对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Clara. - Clara.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.55,1:25:42.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 对不起 - 什么事? 小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Excuse me. - Ma'am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.47,1:25:46.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个人是否个子高高的 有着一双大大的像狗般的棕眼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But was this man tall with great big, brown puppy-dog eyes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.89,1:25:49.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,以及长长的 银白色的直发?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and long silvery, flowing hair?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.47,1:25:50.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你认识他啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.56,1:25:54.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾米!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emmett!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.49,1:26:11.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,时间到了 臭小子!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time's up, runt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.46,1:26:20.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,准备上西天吧 铁匠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare to meet your maker, blacksmith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.38,1:26:22.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就在这里! 添南!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right here, Tannen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.96,1:27:01.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拔枪吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Draw!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.34,1:27:05.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.06,1:27:23.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为我们可以用男子汉的方式来解决此事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought we could settle this like men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.15,1:27:27.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你错了 小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You thought wrong, dude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.34,1:27:50.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢各位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.37,1:28:56.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,打得好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.27,1:28:57.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(堆肥)
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.91,1:29:00.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你们知道吗? - 什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know what I think? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.96,1:29:02.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想贝夫得坐牢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think Buford's going to jail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.25,1:29:03.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.05,1:29:11.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把他从那里面拖出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him out of that shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.22,1:29:12.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去追他们!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.76,1:29:19.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,贝夫·添南 我以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buford Tannen, you're under arrest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.43,1:29:21.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抢劫松树镇驿马车的罪名逮捕你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for robbing the Pine City stage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.48,1:29:23.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你有什么话要说吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got anything to say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.78,1:29:30.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我恨堆肥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate manure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.65,1:29:31.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.45,1:29:36.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.16,1:29:39.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,火车!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The train!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.24,1:29:40.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们来得及吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we make it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.54,1:29:42.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得走郊狼山路拦截他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll have to cut them off at Coyote Pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.96,1:29:47.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先生 伊斯特伍德先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Hey, mister. Mr. Eastwood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.84,1:29:49.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你的枪 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's your gun, mister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.13,1:29:50.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢了 小弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.64,1:29:57.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢穆斯!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seamus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.47,1:30:00.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它值12块 而且不曾使用过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's worth $12. Never been used.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.85,1:30:03.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我会拿它去换顶新帽子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I'll trade it for a new hat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.02,1:30:06.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 记着好好照顾那孩子!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, and take care of that baby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.56,1:30:08.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.49,1:30:23.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾米!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emmett!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.00,1:30:29.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"时光旅行机器"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Time machine."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.13,1:31:14.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,跳!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Marty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.88,1:31:18.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.97,1:31:20.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快 把手伸给我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Give me your hand!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.21,1:31:57.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快啊! 马丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.14,1:32:03.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快 我们上!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.27,1:32:13.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,蒙上面罩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Masks on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.79,1:32:30.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别动!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reach!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.08,1:32:31.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是抢劫吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this a holdup?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.25,1:32:35.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 是个科学实验{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a science experiment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.75,1:32:38.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在到达前面的转换点之前 把火车停下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop the train just before you hit the switch track up ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.44,1:32:55.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.52,1:32:57.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把煤水车和机关车分开!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uncouple the cars from the tender!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.34,1:33:26.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我这辈子一直都想这么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've wanted to do that all my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.34,1:34:01.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这些东西是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are these things, anyway?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.67,1:34:03.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是我土法制造的助燃剂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My own version of Pres-to-Logs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.59,1:34:04.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,将木料和无烟煤屑压缩在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Compressed wood with anthracite dust{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.05,1:34:07.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再加以化学处理 能让火头烧得更热 更持久{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}chemically treated to burn hotter and longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.39,1:34:09.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我平常打铁时都用这个 可以省不少时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I use them in my forge so I don't have to stoke it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.89,1:34:11.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这三个助燃剂将依次点燃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These three in the furnace will ignite sequentially,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.98,1:34:13.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让火烧得更旺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}make the fire burn hotter,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.48,1:34:14.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,增加蒸汽锅炉的功力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}kick up the boiler pressure,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.73,1:34:16.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让火车跑得更快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and make the train go faster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.99,1:34:29.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一切就绪了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready to roll!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.48,1:35:02.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾米!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emmett!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.45,1:35:09.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 时光旅行仪启动了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, are the time circuits on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.12,1:35:12.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,启动 博士!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check, Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.79,1:35:14.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,将目的地的时间输入{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Input the destination time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.95,1:35:18.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,1985年10月27号 早上11点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}October 27, 1985, 11:00 a.m.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.09,1:35:24.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,输入完毕! 好 我们现在以固定的每小时25英里前进 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check. Okay, we're cruising at a steady 25 miles an hour, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.51,1:35:26.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要把助燃剂丢进锅炉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm throwing in the Pres-to-Logs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.98,1:35:37.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 放在车上的新计速表{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, the new gauge on the dashboard{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.85,1:35:39.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,将告诉我们锅炉的温度是多少{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will tell us the boiler temperature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.52,1:35:42.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它以三种颜色显示三个助燃剂的点火时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's color-coded to indicate when each log will fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.98,1:35:44.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,分别是绿 黄和红三种颜色{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Green, yellow and red.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.32,1:35:46.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,每点燃一个时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Each detonation will be accompanied{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.99,1:35:48.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,火车将会突然加速向前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by a sudden burst of acceleration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.99,1:35:52.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,希望我们能在指标达到两千之前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hopefully, we'll hit 88 miles per hour{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.99,1:35:55.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就加速到每小时88英里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before the needle gets much past 2,000.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.95,1:35:58.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么? 超过两千后会怎样?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why? What happens after it hits 2,000?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.75,1:36:00.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,整个锅炉将会爆炸!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The whole boiler explodes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.50,1:36:02.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真是太好了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.56,1:36:20.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 我们加速到35里了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Doc! We just hit 35!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.52,1:36:22.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 马丁 我要过去了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Marty. I'm coming aboard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.20,1:36:36.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾米!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emmett!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.12,1:36:40.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快啊! 快啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.26,1:36:51.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你最好抓紧点 博士!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better hold onto something, Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.76,1:36:53.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,黄色的那个就要点爆了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The yellow log is about to blow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.52,1:36:59.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Golly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.23,1:37:04.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们刚刚超过40里 博士!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just passed 40, Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.46,1:37:39.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾米!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emmett!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.60,1:37:44.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们刚超过45里 博士 加油!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just passed 45, Doc! Go for it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.66,1:37:55.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,50里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fifty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.79,1:38:07.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾米!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emmett!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.92,1:38:08.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克蕾拉!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clara!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.92,1:38:11.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.47,1:38:15.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士! 博士 是怎么回事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc! Doc! What's happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.84,1:38:19.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是克蕾拉 她在车上!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Clara! She's on the train!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.60,1:38:21.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克蕾拉? 这下可好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clara? Perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.64,1:38:25.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她在车上 我要回去接她!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's in the cab! I'm going back for her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.31,1:38:26.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,风车!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The windmill!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.48,1:38:30.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士! 风车 我们已经超过50了 你来不及的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc! The windmill! We're going past 50! You'll never make it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.44,1:38:34.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们只好带她一起回去了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we'll have to take her back with us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.36,1:38:36.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,继续向我回报速度!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep calling out the speed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.95,1:38:40.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克蕾拉 爬到我这边来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clara, climb out here to me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.41,1:38:41.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道我是否办得到!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if I can!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.79,1:38:43.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你办得到!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.33,1:38:45.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别往下看就行了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just don't look down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.92,1:38:50.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就对了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.35,1:39:06.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,每小时60英里 博士!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sixty miles an hour, Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.15,1:39:12.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你做得很好 稳稳地走过来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're doing fine! Nice and steady!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.70,1:39:17.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.91,1:39:19.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再往前一点就行了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a little further!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.07,1:39:22.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我办不到 艾米 我害怕!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't, Emmett! I'm scared!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.54,1:39:25.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,70里!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seventy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.54,1:39:28.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,继续往前走 克蕾拉!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep coming, Clara!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.63,1:39:32.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来啊 来啊! 你做得很好!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Come on! You're doing fine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.88,1:39:37.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来啊! 放轻松!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Nice and easy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.84,1:39:41.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别往下看 这就对了 你做得很好!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't look down! That's it! You're doing fine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.60,1:39:48.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士! 红色的那个要点爆了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc! The red log is about to blow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.40,1:39:57.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克蕾拉!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clara!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.24,1:40:01.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾米!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emmett!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.79,1:40:13.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我试着要抓住你啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying to reach you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.54,1:40:14.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克蕾拉 别松手!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clara, hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.88,1:40:16.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不行!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.31,1:40:28.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 我把飞行滑板传过去给你!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, I'm gonna slip you the Hoverboard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.94,1:40:37.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 当心!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.95,1:40:47.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾米! 救我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emmett, help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.12,1:40:51.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,支持住! 克蕾拉!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on, Clara!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.04,1:40:56.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士! 准备好! 博土{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, ready, Doc?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.88,1:40:58.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,接住!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Catch it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.68,1:41:01.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对! 对!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes! Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.90,1:41:07.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(铁轨尽头)
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.60,1:41:13.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾米!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emmett!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.94,1:41:15.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,撑住!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.99,1:41:19.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.39,1:42:30.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(伊斯特伍德峡谷)
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.48,1:44:01.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Doc,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.52,1:44:05.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它已经被毁掉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.49,1:44:09.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,正如你所希望的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like you wanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.42,1:44:29.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,臭小子 给我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, butthead, get away...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.59,1:44:30.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,讲话小心点! 贝夫!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch it, Biff!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.68,1:44:32.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁! 我不是有意要吓你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, I didn't mean to scare you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.68,1:44:33.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只是你穿着这身衣服我认不出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't recognize you in those clothes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.01,1:44:35.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在做什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.51,1:44:38.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在给你的车打第二层蜡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just putting on the second coat now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.39,1:44:40.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在扮牛仔 是吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You going cowboy, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.85,1:44:43.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 大伙儿 我们快来不及吃早午餐了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, guys. We're gonna be late for brunch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.65,1:44:44.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来了 戴夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming, Dave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.73,1:44:46.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点! 爸 他们不会替我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Dad, we're not gonna hold{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.11,1:44:47.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,留桌子留一整天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your reservations all day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.69,1:44:49.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我找不到我另一副眼镜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't find my glasses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.20,1:44:50.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,洛莲 你有看见我的眼镜吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorraine, have you seen my glasses?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.57,1:44:52.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在你的皮夹克里 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're in your suede jacket, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.70,1:44:55.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 怎么了? 你不是和朋友到湖边去了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, what's wrong? We thought you went to the lake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.45,1:44:56.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你穿着这身衣服到湖边去?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wore that to the lake?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.70,1:44:58.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢天谢地 你们全恢复正常了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank God you guys are all back to normal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.70,1:45:00.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 你在扮谁? 克林特·伊斯特伍德?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, who are you supposed to be? Clint Eastwood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.04,1:45:04.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 我得去找詹妮弗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. I gotta go get Jennifer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.84,1:45:10.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我很喜欢你这顶帽子 马丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really like that hat, Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.47,1:45:12.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢了 贝夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, Biff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.40,1:45:27.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,詹妮弗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jennifer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.78,1:45:31.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,詹妮弗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.28,1:45:36.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,詹妮弗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jennifer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.68,1:46:03.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.27,1:46:07.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我做了一个最可怕的梦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had the worst nightmare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.61,1:46:17.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 我做的那个梦好逼真{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, that dream I had is so real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.16,1:46:19.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是个关于未来的梦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was about the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:19.70,1:46:21.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,关于我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.79,1:46:24.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且你还被炒鱿鱼了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you got fired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.12,1:46:26.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,慢着 你说我被炒鱿鱼 是什么意思?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. What do you mean I got fired?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.38,1:46:28.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"希尔戴尔"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Hilldale."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.88,1:46:33.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,希尔戴尔! 是我们住的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hilldale! This is where we live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.30,1:46:36.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说 这是我们以后住的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, this is where we're going to live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.80,1:46:38.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在将来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.10,1:46:45.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 那是一场梦 不是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, it was a dream, wasn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:49.19,1:46:50.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.61,1:46:52.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是马丁大哥呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The big M.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.82,1:46:54.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,近来如何? 麦佛莱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's it hanging, McFly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.90,1:46:56.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尼德斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Needles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.24,1:47:00.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好正点的车子 让我看看它有什么本事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice set of wheels. Let's see what she can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.45,1:47:01.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到下一个红绿灯为止{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next green light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.62,1:47:02.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 谢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.00,1:47:06.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了? 你没胆?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter? Chicken?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.04,1:47:08.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,胆小鬼麦佛莱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chicken McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.21,1:47:12.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.76,1:47:14.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,坐稳了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab hold of something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.17,1:47:16.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,加油! 加油!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Get on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.30,1:47:20.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,加油! 要他好看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, go! Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.16,1:47:44.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是故意这么做的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you do that on purpose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:44.58,1:47:47.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想我会笨得想跟那个王八蛋比快?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you think I'm stupid enough to race that asshole?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.25,1:47:56.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天 我可能会撞上那辆劳斯莱斯的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jeez! I would have hit that Rolls-Royce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.70,1:48:06.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(你被炒鱿鱼了){\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.10,1:48:07.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,字消失了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It erased.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.95,1:48:23.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对 确实没剩下什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right. There's not much left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.41,1:48:28.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士永远不会回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc's never coming back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.93,1:48:44.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会很怀念他的 珍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure gonna miss him, Jen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.23,1:48:58.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到底是怎么回事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.75,1:49:16.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.38,1:49:18.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.55,1:49:20.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士! 博士!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc! Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.80,1:49:23.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马丁 它是由蒸汽推动的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, it runs on steam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.97,1:49:32.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,见过我的全家福 克蕾拉 你已经认识了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meet the family. Clara, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.56,1:49:33.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨! 马丁!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Marty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:33.81,1:49:34.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,夫人!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ma'am!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.94,1:49:38.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,以及我的小犬们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are our boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.90,1:49:42.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,儒勒 还有凡尔纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jules and Verne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.82,1:49:48.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,儿子们 这两位是马丁和詹妮弗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boys, this is Marty and Jennifer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.66,1:49:53.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士 我还以为我再也见不到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, I thought I'd never see you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.71,1:49:55.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个优秀的科学家是闲不住的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't keep a good scientist down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:56.00,1:49:58.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟 我得回来接爱因斯坦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After all, I had to come back for Einstein,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.21,1:50:01.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且 我不希望你为我担心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and, well, I didn't want you to be worried about me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.59,1:50:06.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我给你带来了一个纪念品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I brought you a little souvenir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.74,1:50:25.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这太棒了! 博士 谢了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's great, Doc. Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.28,1:50:32.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,布朗博士? 我从未来带回来这张纸条{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Brown, I brought this note back from the future,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:32.20,1:50:34.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在它上面的字消失了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and now it's erased.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.54,1:50:36.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它当然消失了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course it's erased.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.42,1:50:39.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但这是表示什么呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what does that mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.84,1:50:43.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这表示你们的未来尚未成定局{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means your future hasn't been written yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.80,1:50:45.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁都一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one's has.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:45.63,1:50:48.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们的未来是掌握在你们的手上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your future is whatever you make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.14,1:50:50.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以好好把握吧 你们两个都一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So make it a good one, both of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.81,1:50:55.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会的 博士!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will, Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:55.10,1:50:56.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,退后点!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.15,1:50:59.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 小子们 往后面一点!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, boys, buckle up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.24,1:51:09.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对了 博士 你们现在要去哪? 回到未来去?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Doc, where are you going now? Back to the future?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.99,1:51:13.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 已经去过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, already been there.{\r}
